ourney from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world, highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Music","Drama"],"release_date":"2026-04-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ufSwlnECLoUbBjPrFqEQcWBzHwc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dueFqKLvjftnELZaGYwY7xinfaI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ufSwlnECLoUbBjPrFqEQcWBzHwc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dueFqKLvjftnELZaGYwY7xinfaI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1232449,"title":"Young Hearts","description":"14-year-old Elias increasingly feels like an outsider in his village. When he meets his new neighbour of the same age, Alexander, Elias is confronted with his burgeoning sexuality.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2024-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3HaqAPZ0C8n6Hd5T86U53yJlBAN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iGCtYxfuvXfy0BD5m6p7vKuPOxS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3HaqAPZ0C8n6Hd5T86U53yJlBAN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iGCtYxfuvXfy0BD5m6p7vKuPOxS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":389,"title":"12 Angry Men","description":"The defense and the prosecution have rested and the jury is filing into the jury room to decide if a young Spanish-American is guilty or innocent of murdering his father. What begins as an open and shut case soon becomes a mini-drama of each of the jurors'' prejudices and preconceptions about the trial, the accused, and each other.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1957-04-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qqHQsStV6exghCM7zbObuYBiYxw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zhG3vKWyDRaZYoaww1UVAi29T9h.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qqHQsStV6exghCM7zbObuYBiYxw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zhG3vKWyDRaZYoaww1UVAi29T9h.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":240,"title":"The Godfather Part II","description":"In the continuing saga of the Corleone crime family, a young Vito Corleone grows up in Sicily and in 1910s New York. In the 1950s, Michael Corleone attempts to expand the family business into Las Vegas, Hollywood and Cuba.","duration":"3:22:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1974-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pGzqRKrYeK4LogoysNro0vG8d8N.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8a1lJs7mFyGhGhZZDT1azJUoQiZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pGzqRKrYeK4LogoysNro0vG8d8N.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8a1lJs7mFyGhGhZZDT1azJUoQiZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":424,"title":"Schindler''s List","description":"The true story of how businessman Oskar Schindler saved over a thousand Jewish lives from the Nazis while they worked as slaves in his factory during World War II.","duration":"3:15:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1993-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zb6fM1CX41D9rF9hdgclu0peUmy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sF1U4EUQS8YHUYjNl3pMGNIQyr0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zb6fM1CX41D9rF9hdgclu0peUmy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sF1U4EUQS8YHUYjNl3pMGNIQyr0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1630423,"title":"My Dearest Assassin","description":"Hunted for her rare blood type, a caged woman vows to fight alongside the assassin she loves to protect their future when an old enemy resurfaces.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2026-05-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xA6AM5MvEkieZKlv1Tn3sN23I7i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ul4dQcA68mtSx8J56N5gEcaCCtP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xA6AM5MvEkieZKlv1Tn3sN23I7i.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ul4dQcA68mtSx8J56N5gEcaCCtP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1218925,"title":"Chainsaw Man - The Movie: Reze Arc","description":"In a brutal war between devils, hunters, and secret enemies, a mysterious girl named Reze has stepped into Denji''s world, and he faces his deadliest battle yet, fueled by love in a world where survival knows no rules.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2025-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gqTz24ZRsCP6AKjARmEivY7m0cK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pHyxb2RV5wLlboAwm9ZJ9qTVEDw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gqTz24ZRsCP6AKjARmEivY7m0cK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pHyxb2RV5wLlboAwm9ZJ9qTVEDw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":155,"title":"The Dark Knight","description":"Batman raises the stakes in his war on crime. With the help of Lt. Jim Gordon and District Attorney Harvey Dent, Batman sets out to dismantle the remaining criminal organizations that plague the streets. The partnership proves to be effective, but they soon find themselves prey to a reign of chaos unleashed by a rising criminal mastermind known to the terrified citizens of Gotham as the Joker.","duration":"2:32:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2008-07-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9FE5eD92WfVCiivM9Pq9GVSrlWk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9FE5eD92WfVCiivM9Pq9GVSrlWk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qJ2tW6WMUDux911r6m7haRef0WH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":129,"title":"Spirited Away","description":"A young girl, Chihiro, becomes trapped in a strange new world of spirits. When her parents undergo a mysterious transformation, she must call upon the courage she never knew she had to free her family.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2001-07-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6oaL4DP75yABrd5EbC4H2zq5ghc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/39wmItIWsg5sZMyRUHLkWBcuVCM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6oaL4DP75yABrd5EbC4H2zq5ghc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//39wmItIWsg5sZMyRUHLkWBcuVCM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1466115,"title":"Even If This Love Disappears Tonight","description":"A high school girl wakes up each day with no memory of yesterday. When she agrees to date a shy classmate, can their love grow with every new beginning?","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2025-12-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iL5eGI9ctHdUOV4yG6dyGKctSEX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5eNN8KLDPUXDqIkTdCbmn1gx5P7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iL5eGI9ctHdUOV4yG6dyGKctSEX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5eNN8KLDPUXDqIkTdCbmn1gx5P7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":497,"title":"The Green Mile","description":"A supernatural tale set on death row in a Southern prison, where gentle giant John Coffey possesses the mysterious power to heal people''s ailments. When the cell block''s head guard, Paul Edgecomb, recognizes Coffey''s miraculous gift, he tries desperately to help stave off the condemned man''s execution.","duration":"3:09:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1999-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/amZavErrjrdgDwhsIdpWxHNenIx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8VG8fDNiy50H4FedGwdSVUPoaJe.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//amZavErrjrdgDwhsIdpWxHNenIx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8VG8fDNiy50H4FedGwdSVUPoaJe.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":122,"title":"The Lord of the Rings: The Return of the King","description":"As armies mass for a final battle that will decide the fate of the world--and powerful, ancient forces of Light and Dark compete to determine the outcome--one member of the Fellowship of the Ring is revealed as the noble heir to the throne of the Kings of Men. Yet, the sole hope for triumph over evil lies with a brave hobbit, Frodo, who, accompanied by his loyal friend Sam and the hideous, wretched Gollum, ventures deep into the very dark heart of Mordor on his seemingly impossible quest to destroy the Ring of Power.​","duration":"3:21:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy","Action"],"release_date":"2003-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ctiw6FZK4N36LmkjSklWEbuvlq9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rCzpDGLbOoPwLjy3OAm5NUPOTrC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ctiw6FZK4N36LmkjSklWEbuvlq9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rCzpDGLbOoPwLjy3OAm5NUPOTrC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":19404,"title":"Dilwale Dulhania Le Jayenge","description":"Raj is a rich, carefree, happy-go-lucky second generation NRI. Simran is the daughter of Chaudhary Baldev Singh, who in spite of being an NRI is very strict about adherence to Indian values. Simran has left for India to be married to her childhood fiancé. Raj leaves for India with a mission at his hands, to claim his lady love under the noses of her whole family. Thus begins a saga.","duration":"3:10:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-10-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7VDLEHli74eLsYLNcq9djn1Gw76.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lfRkUr7DYdHldAqi3P