an channel primal male aggression into a shocking new form of therapy. Their concept catches on, with underground \"fight clubs\" forming in every town, until an eccentric gets in the way and ignites an out-of-control spiral toward oblivion.","duration":"2:19:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1999-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c6OLXfKAk5BKeR6broC8pYiCquX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jSziioSwPVrOy9Yow3XhWIBDjq1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c6OLXfKAk5BKeR6broC8pYiCquX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jSziioSwPVrOy9Yow3XhWIBDjq1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":637,"title":"Life Is Beautiful","description":"A touching story of an Italian book seller of Jewish ancestry who lives in his own little fairy tale. His creative and happy life would come to an abrupt halt when his entire family is deported to a concentration camp during World War II. While locked up he tries to convince his son that the whole thing is just a game.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1997-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6aNKD81RHR1DqUUa8kOZ1TBY1Lp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/74hLDKjD5aGYOotO6esUVaeISa2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6aNKD81RHR1DqUUa8kOZ1TBY1Lp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//74hLDKjD5aGYOotO6esUVaeISa2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1291559,"title":"Drawing Closer","description":"With only a year left to live, 17-year-old Akito finds new meaning in life by bringing joy to a terminally ill girl who has just six months remaining.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2024-06-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6tTC2ooNo2KMgjosWCPfTOSOevE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/173FD4a0rpSF30z4CoWx6qdx8Ry.jpg","small_back