e to be judged by Christ, the Devil and the Virgin Mary before they are admitted to paradise.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Fantasy","Romance"],"release_date":"2000-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/alQqTpmEkxSLgajfEYTsTH6nAKB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z9Au9XtK0ARzkKGsZCzMkmKgMPf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//alQqTpmEkxSLgajfEYTsTH6nAKB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z9Au9XtK0ARzkKGsZCzMkmKgMPf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":539,"title":"Psycho","description":"When larcenous real estate clerk Marion Crane goes on the lam with a wad of cash and hopes of starting a new life, she ends up at the notorious Bates Motel, where manager Norman Bates cares for his housebound mother.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Horror","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"1960-06-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mufF1aYvwdpKerhq5R1YrVcbJLY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yz4QVqPx3h1hD1DfqqQkCq3rmxW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mufF1aYvwdpKerhq5R1YrVcbJLY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yz4QVqPx3h1hD1DfqqQkCq3rmxW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":510,"title":"One Flew Over the Cuckoo''s Nest","description":"A petty criminal fakes insanity to serve his sentence in a mental ward rather than prison. He soon finds himself as a leader to the other patients—and an enemy to the cruel, domineering nurse who runs the ward.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1975-11-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uA8eSNAUUUyfHNIrG4h0zHxzt9W.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kjWsMh72V6d8KRLV4EOoSJLT1H7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uA8eSNAUUUyfHNIrG4h0zHxzt9W.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kjWsMh72V6d8KRLV4EOoSJLT1H7.jpg"},{"