ctor, a talented young drummer begins to pursue perfection at any cost, even his humanity.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Music","Thriller"],"release_date":"2014-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fRGxZuo7jJUWQsVg9PREb98Aclp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7fn624j5lj3xTme2SgiLCeuedmO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fRGxZuo7jJUWQsVg9PREb98Aclp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7fn624j5lj3xTme2SgiLCeuedmO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27205,"title":"Inception","description":"Cobb, a skilled thief who commits corporate espionage by infiltrating the subconscious of his targets is offered a chance to regain his old life as payment for a task considered to be impossible: \"inception\", the implantation of another person''s idea into a target''s subconscious.","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Crime"],"release_date":"2010-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8ZTVqvKDQ8emSGUEMjsS4yHAwrp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xlaY2zyzMfkhk0HSC5VUwzoZPU1.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8ZTVqvKDQ8emSGUEMjsS4yHAwrp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xlaY2zyzMfkhk0HSC5VUwzoZPU1.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":423,"title":"The Pianist","description":"The true story of pianist Władysław Szpilman''s experiences in Warsaw during the Nazi occupation. When the Jews of the city find themselves forced into a ghetto, Szpilman finds work playing in a café; and when his family is deported in 1942, he stays behind, works for a while as a laborer, and eventually goes into hiding in the ruins of the war-torn city.","duration":"2:30:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"2002-09-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c0fB9xk7D1aVb3Bg2rk2SVJcGn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2hFvxCCWrTmCYwfy