":901,"title":"City Lights","description":"A tramp falls in love with a beautiful blind flower girl. His on-and-off friendship with a wealthy man allows him to be the girl''s benefactor and suitor.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1931-02-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Ma7mQsldFCaQpsZbm8zolgLfmV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bXNvzjULc9jrOVhGfjcc64uKZmZ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Ma7mQsldFCaQpsZbm8zolgLfmV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bXNvzjULc9jrOVhGfjcc64uKZmZ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1355666,"title":"Love Untangled","description":"A lovestruck teen plans to win the school heartthrob by going from curly to straight hair — until a new transfer student changes everything.","duration":"2:01:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2025-08-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oBcvmHD7lbaX8RZ7NXvO05fIJef.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e7jStO2xfBUAUK37LbINHd1qtgy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oBcvmHD7lbaX8RZ7NXvO05fIJef.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e7jStO2xfBUAUK37LbINHd1qtgy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":299536,"title":"Avengers: Infinity War","description":"As the Avengers and their allies have continued to protect the world from threats too large for any one hero to handle, a new danger has emerged from the cosmic shadows: Thanos. A despot of intergalactic infamy, his goal is to collect all six Infinity Stones, artifacts of unimaginable power, and use them to inflict his twisted will on all of reality. Everything the Avengers have fought for has led up to this moment - the fate of Earth and existence itself has never been more uncertain.","duration":"2:29:00","genre":["Adventure","Action","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2018-04-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mDfJG3LC3Dqb67AZ52x3Z0jU0uB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7WsyChQLEftFiDOVTGkv3hFpyyt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mDfJG3LC3Dqb67AZ52x3Z0jU0uB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7WsyChQLEftFiDOVTGkv3hFpyyt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29259,"title":"Le Trou","description":"Four prison inmates have been hatching a plan to literally dig out of jail when another prisoner, Claude Gaspard, is moved into their cell. They take a risk and share their plan with the newcomer. Over the course of three days, the prisoners and friends break through the concrete floor using a bed post and begin to make their way through the sewer system – yet their escape is anything but assured.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1960-03-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/f72GEQF2lKsdmEULSI9bWCbQylH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xyZhiOz5NHVBUKlpioxjwajy7pm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//f72GEQF2lKsdmEULSI9bWCbQylH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xyZhiOz5NHVBUKlpioxjwajy7pm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":20941,"title":"Innocent Voices","description":"A young boy, attempting to have a normal childhood in 1980s El Salvador, is caught up in a dramatic fight for his life when he desperately tries to avoid the war that is raging all around him.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"2005-01-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oaUWMPGxpb4OsVCrppmlhQA2bwb.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hvwB4LdMCLzqXsk5ZjR77vzPkGk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oaUWMPGxpb4OsVCrppmlhQA2bwb.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hvwB4LdMCLzqXsk5ZjR77vzPkGk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24188,"title":"Il Sorpasso","description":"Roberto, a shy law student in Rome, meets Bruno, a forty-year-old exuberant, capricious man, who takes him for a drive through the Roman and Tuscany countries in the summer. When their journey starts to blend into their daily lives though, the pair’s newfound friendship is tested.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"1962-12-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uUrV5KSjnZx47Dq7e6STr73iN4N.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4h1ckrJQVcQYjeOkqS8i9BqZ9MI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uUrV5KSjnZx47Dq7e6STr73iN4N.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4h1ckrJQVcQYjeOkqS8i9BqZ9MI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9702,"title":"Bound by Honor","description":"Based on the true life experiences of poet Jimmy Santiago Baca, the film focuses on half-brothers Paco and Cruz, and their bi-racial cousin Miklo. It opens in 1972, as the three are members of an East L.A. gang known as the \"Vatos Locos\", and the story focuses on how a violent crime and the influence of narcotics alter their lives. Miklo is incarcerated and sent to San Quentin, where he makes a \"home\" for himself. Cruz becomes an exceptional artist, but a heroin addiction overcomes him with tragic results. Paco becomes a cop and an enemy to his \"carnal\", Miklo.","duration":"3:10:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1993-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9xjUZjuYyehv2qnqMH0oR9nSTft.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8t9ojZ7fyn5iTqKCVjGvJ6nMacN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9xjUZjuYyehv2qnqMH0oR9nSTft.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8t9ojZ7fyn5iTqKCVjGvJ6nMacN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":670,"title":"Oldboy","description":"With no clue how he came to be imprisoned, drugged and tortured for 15 years, a desperate man seeks revenge on his captors.","duration":"2:00:00","genre"