 his devious son takes power and demotes Maximus, one of Rome''s most capable generals who Marcus preferred. Eventually, Maximus is forced to become a gladiator and battle to the death against other men for the amusement of paying audiences.","duration":"2:35:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"2000-05-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/Ar7QuJ7sJEiC0oP3I8fKBKIQD9u.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aDb548BOkFfI4nFm0kx8A3Ezh7H.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//Ar7QuJ7sJEiC0oP3I8fKBKIQD9u.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aDb548BOkFfI4nFm0kx8A3Ezh7H.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":490132,"title":"Green Book","description":"Tony Lip, a bouncer in 1962, is hired to drive pianist Don Shirley on a tour through the Deep South in the days when African Americans, forced to find alternate accommodations and services due to segregation laws below the Mason-Dixon Line, relied on a guide called The Negro Motorist Green Book.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","History"],"release_date":"2018-11-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5En0fmDagt3Pk8d7P3uTwfeQceg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7BsvSuDQuoqhWmU2fL7W2GOcZHU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5En0fmDagt3Pk8d7P3uTwfeQceg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7BsvSuDQuoqhWmU2fL7W2GOcZHU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":447362,"title":"Life in a Year","description":"A 17 year old finds out that his girlfriend is dying, so he sets out to give her an entire life, in the last year she has left.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2020-11-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u6aGN71Hx39iX8Uv4ILRRKHmAXc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bP7u19opmHXYeTCUwGjlLldmUMc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.o