ario Galaxy Movie","description":"Having thwarted Bowser''s previous plot to marry Princess Peach, Mario and Luigi now face a fresh threat in Bowser Jr., who is determined to liberate his father from captivity and restore the family legacy. Alongside companions new and old, the brothers travel across the stars to stop the young heir''s crusade.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Adventure","Fantasy","Animation"],"release_date":"2026-04-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kxQiIJ4gVcD3K6o14MJ72p5yRcE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eJGWx219ZcEMVQJhAgMiqo8tYY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":110420,"title":"Wolf Children","description":"After her werewolf lover unexpectedly dies in an accident, a woman must find a way to raise the son and daughter that she had with him. However, their inheritance of their father''s traits prove to be a challenge for her.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oMqgJMCaNIqeJtilc71D4nRqdmt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vHMvBkr42Gh3OORcnmfCFfqJ1E.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oMqgJMCaNIqeJtilc71D4nRqdmt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vHMvBkr42Gh3OORcnmfCFfqJ1E.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16869,"title":"Inglourious Basterds","description":"In Nazi-occupied France during World War II, a group of Jewish-American soldiers known as \"The Basterds\" are chosen specifically to spread fear throughout the Third Reich by scalping and brutally killing Nazis. The Basterds, lead by Lt. Aldo Raine soon cross paths with a French-Jewish teenage girl who runs a movie theater in Paris which is targeted by the soldiers."