hters, against his family''s wishes. There he meets a girl, Glasha, who accompanies him back to his village. On returning home, Flyora finds his family and fellow peasants massacred. His continued survival amidst the brutal debris of war becomes increasingly nightmarish, a battle between despair and hope.","duration":"2:22:00","genre":["Drama","War","Horror","History"],"release_date":"1985-10-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Na31ta8vDuKOgQuPLdSZLs8bCB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qNbMsKVzigERgJUbwf8pKyZogpb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Na31ta8vDuKOgQuPLdSZLs8bCB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qNbMsKVzigERgJUbwf8pKyZogpb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":568332,"title":"Taylor Swift: Reputation Stadium Tour","description":"Taylor Swift takes the stage in Dallas for the Reputation Stadium Tour and celebrates a monumental night of music, memories and visual magic.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Music"],"release_date":"2018-12-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4uMrZS7XEHRNKwHr5wSOxROanPF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u6oXUTtOuJRPdUgUuPAVVJPSKCo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4uMrZS7XEHRNKwHr5wSOxROanPF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u6oXUTtOuJRPdUgUuPAVVJPSKCo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":284,"title":"The Apartment","description":"Bud Baxter is a minor clerk in a huge New York insurance company, until he discovers a quick way to climb the corporate ladder. He lends out his apartment to the executives as a place to take their mistresses. Although he often has to deal with the aftermath of their visits, one night he''s left with a major problem to solve.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1960-06-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vRTKNKNWLZ22fAgPa5kY8wT2b1F.jpg","poster_pa