ve to deal with a new life scenario: Marcelina is pregnant and Juliano is getting married.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2019-12-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/19vTfircuojU00I6xtRdy3DrF1e.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zw77BFPGJ73Lig8GwRzYj1XHq53.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//19vTfircuojU00I6xtRdy3DrF1e.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zw77BFPGJ73Lig8GwRzYj1XHq53.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":290098,"title":"The Handmaiden","description":"1930s Korea, in the period of Japanese occupation, a new girl, Sook-hee, is hired as a handmaiden to a Japanese heiress, Hideko, who lives a secluded life on a large countryside estate with her domineering Uncle Kouzuki. But the maid has a secret. She is a pickpocket recruited by a swindler posing as a Japanese Count to help him seduce the Lady to steal her fortune.","duration":"2:25:00","genre":["Thriller","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2016-06-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2b3RNXF7ca9bgX8FrjRBYfLnNQC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dLlH4aNHdnmf62umnInL8xPlPzw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2b3RNXF7ca9bgX8FrjRBYfLnNQC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dLlH4aNHdnmf62umnInL8xPlPzw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":348,"title":"Alien","description":"During its return to the earth, commercial spaceship Nostromo intercepts a distress signal from a distant planet. When a three-member team of the crew discovers a chamber containing thousands of eggs on the planet, a creature inside one of the eggs attacks an explorer. The entire crew is unaware of the impending nightmare set to descend upon them when the alien parasite planted inside its unfortunate host is birthed.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Horror","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1979-05-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AmR3JG1VQVxU8TfAvljUhfSFUOx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vfrQk5IPloGg1v9Rzbh2Eg3VGyM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AmR3JG1VQVxU8TfAvljUhfSFUOx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vfrQk5IPloGg1v9Rzbh2Eg3VGyM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3780,"title":"Red Beard","description":"Aspiring to an easy job as personal physician to a wealthy family, Noboru Yasumoto is disappointed when his first post after medical school takes him to a small country clinic under the gruff doctor Red Beard. Yasumoto rebels in numerous ways, but Red Beard proves a wise and patient teacher. He gradually introduces his student to the unglamorous side of the profession, ultimately assigning him to care for a prostitute rescued from a local brothel.","duration":"3:05:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1965-03-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jJK3skg06c2iUXgpJg9DTxQhRb4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iYNH3Re0JSypoYaWvZtERUnNaJL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jJK3skg06c2iUXgpJg9DTxQhRb4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iYNH3Re0JSypoYaWvZtERUnNaJL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":280,"title":"Terminator 2: Judgment Day","description":"Ten years after the events of the original, a reprogrammed T-800 is sent back in time to protect young John Connor from the shape-shifting T-1000. Together with his mother Sarah, he fights to stop Skynet from triggering a nuclear apocalypse.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Action","Thriller","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1991-07-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/izkMjmhauFx9DjoBQqM5sM5WAwE.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jFTVD4XoWQTcg7wdyJKa8PEds5q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//izkMjmhauFx9DjoBQqM5sM5WAwE.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jFTVD4XoWQTcg7wdyJKa8PEds5q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":77,"title":"Memento","description":"Leonard Shelby is tracking down the man who raped and murdered his wife. The difficulty of locating his wife''s killer, however, is compounded by the fact that he suffers from a rare, untreatable form of short-term memory loss. Although he can recall details of life before his accident, Leonard cannot remember what happened fifteen minutes ago, where he''s going, or why.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"2000-10-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Wev9JMo6R5XAfz2KDvXb7oPMmy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nzlv62aC0octS5AklAiWpXLX9Z0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Wev9JMo6R5XAfz2KDvXb7oPMmy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nzlv62aC0octS5AklAiWpXLX9Z0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1160164,"title":"TAYLOR SWIFT | THE ERAS TOUR","description":"A concert film documenting Taylor Swift''s record-breaking Eras Tour (2023-2024). Filmed during the Los Angeles shows, the film captures the tour''s ten acts, each representing a different musical era from Swift''s career. The film showcases over 40 songs, elaborate stage productions, and Swift''s performance.","duration":"2:49:00","genre":["Music"],"release_date":"2023-10-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wVJG3u5Ru9tInxYiTCrJr4MpJ7Z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jf3YO8hOqGHCupsREf5qymYq1n.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wVJG3u5Ru9tInxYiTCrJr4MpJ7Z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jf3YO8hOqGHCupsREf5qymYq1n.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":185,"title":"A Clockwork Orange","description":"In a near-future Britain, young Alexander DeLarge and his pals get their kicks beating and raping anyone they please. When not destroying the lives of others, Alex swoons to the music of Beethoven. The state, eager to crack down on juvenile crime, gives an incarcerated Alex the option to undergo an invasive procedure that''ll rob him of all personal agency. In a time when conscience is a commodity, can Alex change his tune?","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Crime"],"release_date":"1971-10-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nLFxvLokHe3bQmrmAfljIfax2jQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uBB2SoceeHndk1lgBgTxXpMocFg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nLFxvLokHe3bQmrmAfljIfax2jQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uBB2SoceeHndk1lgBgTxXpMocFg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":851644,"title":"20th Century Girl","description":"In 1999, a teen girl keeps close tabs on a boy in school on behalf of her deeply smitten best friend – then she gets swept up in a love story of her own.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-10-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/37y53Jt8K6MvN6s4zJVFa61luO2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/od22ftNnyag0TTxcnJhlsu3aLoU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//37y53Jt8K6MvN6s4zJVFa61luO2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//od22ftNnyag0TTxcnJhlsu3aLoU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":441130,"title":"Wolfwalkers","description":"In a time of superstition and magic, when wolves are seen as demonic and nature an evil to be tamed, a young apprentice hunter comes to Ireland with her father to wipe out the last pack. But when she saves a wild native girl, their friendship leads her to discover the world of the Wolfwalkers and transform her into the very thing her father is tasked to destroy.","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2020-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3zTbERSBLh7waK9811RTKGAcG86.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_