ntire existence may be staged and observed by a vast unseen audience as part of a long-running real-time reality TV show.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"1998-06-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rmiG2uwcNoGFmBKMoa1pIcf514L.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vuza0WqY239yBXOadKlGwJsZJFE.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rmiG2uwcNoGFmBKMoa1pIcf514L.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vuza0WqY239yBXOadKlGwJsZJFE.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5156,"title":"Bicycle Thieves","description":"Unemployed Antonio is elated when he finally finds work hanging posters around war-torn Rome. However on his first day, his bicycle—essential to his work—gets stolen. His job is doomed unless he can find the thief. With the help of his son, Antonio combs the city, becoming desperate for justice.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1948-07-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nd6ItWuWGmTKhHXuxVC8kp86CmQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iPdVqIpmR3bRvOQJPrn4pr2KR3q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nd6ItWuWGmTKhHXuxVC8kp86CmQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iPdVqIpmR3bRvOQJPrn4pr2KR3q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1422,"title":"The Departed","description":"To take down South Boston''s Irish Mafia, the police send in one of their own to infiltrate the underworld, not realizing the syndicate has done likewise. While an undercover cop curries favor with the mob kingpin, a career criminal rises through the police ranks. But both sides soon discover there''s a mole among them.","duration":"2:31:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2006-10-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6WRrGYalXXveItfpnipYdayFkQB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nT97ifVT2J1yMQmeq20Qblg61T.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6WRrGYalXXveItfpnipYdayFkQB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nT97ifVT2J1yMQmeq20Qblg61T.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":361743,"title":"Top Gun: Maverick","description":"After more than thirty years of service as one of the Navy’s top aviators, and dodging the advancement in rank that would ground him, Pete “Maverick” Mitchell finds himself training a detachment of TOP GUN graduates for a specialized mission the likes of which no living pilot has ever seen.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-05-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AaV1YIdWKnjAIAOe8UUKBFm327v.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n0YuM4f5lvGAP6MAW2kBIzugXnc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AaV1YIdWKnjAIAOe8UUKBFm327v.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n0YuM4f5lvGAP6MAW2kBIzugXnc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":81481,"title":"Silenced","description":"Based on actual events that took place at Gwangju Inhwa School for the hearing-impaired, where young deaf students were the victims of repeated sexual assaults by faculty members over a period of five years in the early 2000s.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2011-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3xTS1lDlbpwg63slWSMeHdamOS1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mbMp0oIFmYnw0i5gzRoKt8cH5ve.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3xTS1lDlbpwg63slWSMeHdamOS1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mbMp0oIFmYnw0i5gzRoKt8cH5ve.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":111,"title":"Scarface","description":"After getting a green card in exchange for assassinating a Cuban government official, Tony Montana stakes a claim on the drug trade in Miami. Viciously murdering anyone who stands in his way, Tony eventually becomes the biggest drug lord in the state, controlling nearly all the cocaine that comes through Miami. But increased pressure from the police, wars with Colombian drug cartels and his own drug-fueled paranoia serve to fuel the flames of his eventual downfall.","duration":"2:50:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1983-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cCvp5Sni75agCtyJkNOMapORUQV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iQ5ztdjvteGeboxtmRdXEChJOHh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cCvp5Sni75agCtyJkNOMapORUQV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iQ5ztdjvteGeboxtmRdXEChJOHh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31217,"title":"The Human Condition I: No Greater Love","description":"After handing in a report on the treatment of Chinese colonial labor, Kaji is offered the post of labour chief at a large mining operation in Manchuria, which also grants him exemption from military service. He accepts and moves with his newlywed wife Michiko, but when he tries to put his ideas of more humane treatment into practice, he finds himself at odds with scheming officials, cruel foremen, and the military police.","duration":"3:24:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"1959-01-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/d9IXxTrra12erdjVXoWUhuTVzTH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/q7godavx5XEbeVxEeqi4pmiOKdI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//d9IXxTrra12erdjVXoWUhuTVzTH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//q7godavx5XEbeVxEeqi4pmiOKdI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18148,"title":"Tokyo Story","description":"The elderly Shukishi and his wife, Tomi, take the long journey from their small seaside village to visit their adult children in Tokyo. Their elder son, Koichi, a doctor, and their daughter, Shige, a hairdresser, don''t have much time to spend with their aged parents, and so it falls to Noriko, the widow of their younger son who was killed in the war, to keep her in-laws company.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1953-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jLq0ol1f0ZKXni9R9GsPBcyPrNN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g2YbTYKpY7N2yDSk7BfXZ18I5QV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jLq0ol1f0ZKXni9R9GsPBcyPrNN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g2YbTYKpY7N2yDSk7BfXZ18I5QV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":522924,"title":"The Art of Racing in the Rain","description":"A family dog – with a near-human soul and a philosopher''s mind – evaluates his life through the lessons learned by his human owner, a race-car driver.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-08-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/96sS0woEzf0zFSWjHVblOhsBfGd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mi5VN4ww0JZgRFJIaPxxTGKjUg7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//96sS0woEzf0zFSWjHVblOhsBfGd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mi5VN4ww0JZgRFJIaPxxTGKjUg7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":517814,"title":"Capernaum","description":"After running away from his negligent parents, committing a violent crime and being sentenced to five years in jail, a hardened, streetwise 12-year-old Lebanese boy sues his parents in protest of the life they have given him.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2018-09-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sEW8q9al73rtow257dXAusD9yS7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mFnfTVADj8yOxwzprYOmTPselk8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sEW8q9al73rtow257dXAusD9yS7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mFnfTVADj8yOxwzprYOmTPselk8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":693134,"title":"Dune: Part Two","description":"Follow the mythic journey of Paul Atreides as he unites with Cha