.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5nkKy7eEDsXqsxFLJy3GxZhE90J.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hL3NqRE2ccR4Y2sYSJTrmalRjrz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5nkKy7eEDsXqsxFLJy3GxZhE90J.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hL3NqRE2ccR4Y2sYSJTrmalRjrz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":490,"title":"The Seventh Seal","description":"When disillusioned Swedish knight Antonius Block returns home from the Crusades to find his country in the grips of the Black Death, he challenges Death to a chess match for his life. Tormented by the belief that God does not exist, Block sets off on a journey, meeting up with traveling players Jof and his wife, Mia, and becoming determined to evade Death long enough to commit one redemptive act while he still lives.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama"],"release_date":"1957-02-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6s2BqtDvp1BMiP70zCDU5OW6hMy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wcZ21zrOsy0b52AfAF50XpTiv75.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6s2BqtDvp1BMiP70zCDU5OW6hMy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wcZ21zrOsy0b52AfAF50XpTiv75.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":575813,"title":"Better Days","description":"A bullied teenage girl forms an unlikely friendship with a mysterious young man who protects her from her assailants, while she copes with the pressures of her final examinations.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Romance"],"release_date":"2019-10-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/putsivYODgbKrhvwl9n4OqhPOkO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/csVZ2ZQCj98XdZoCuW1aixMYJ0W.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//putsivYODgbKrhvwl9n4OqhPOkO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//csVZ2ZQCj98XdZoCuW1aixMYJ0W.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":499028,"title":"Be With You","description":"Along with his young son, Ji-ho, Woo-jin misses his wife Soo-a, who died after promising to return a year later with the rainy season. Miraculously, they reunite with Soo-a when the rainy season comes around, but she has no memory of her husband and son whom she dearly loved.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2018-03-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dw9KDRImNzj3jWYSkTte7wvzamO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mvstNgM68EyCRWwpArakLhWvvtk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dw9KDRImNzj3jWYSkTte7wvzamO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mvstNgM68EyCRWwpArakLhWvvtk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":399106,"title":"Piper","description":"A mother bird tries to teach her little one how to find food by herself. In the process, she encounters a traumatic experience that she must overcome in order to survive.","duration":"0:06:00","genre":["Family","Animation"],"release_date":"2016-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4GWYk5VP9qu1rNSeNAwNaBy9mwS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5fu2d809jepLwEpES7wggiECLoQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4GWYk5VP9qu1rNSeNAwNaBy9mwS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5fu2d809jepLwEpES7wggiECLoQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":592350,"title":"My Hero Academia: Heroes Rising","description":"Class 1-A visits Nabu Island where they finally get to do some real hero work. The place is so peaceful that it''s more like a vacation... until they''re attacked by a villain with an unfathomable Quirk! His power is eerily familiar, and it looks like Shigaraki had a hand in the plan. But with All Might retired and citizens'' lives on the line, there''s no time for questions. Deku and his friends are the next generation of heroes, and they''re the island''s only hope.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2019-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9guoVF7zayiiUq5ulKQpt375VIy.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kpWsIkfXrnQ1pmR79qAHHq7DPxc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9guoVF7zayiiUq5ulKQpt375VIy.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kpWsIkfXrnQ1pmR79qAHHq7DPxc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":426,"title":"Vertigo","description":"A retired San Francisco detective suffering from acrophobia investigates the strange activities of an old friend''s wife, all the while becoming dangerously obsessed with her.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Mystery","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"1958-05-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rtVwkTqllcmyY4TVOycgVBHppWf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/15uOEfqBNTVtDUT7hGBVCka0rZz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rtVwkTqllcmyY4TVOycgVBHppWf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//15uOEfqBNTVtDUT7hGBVCka0rZz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":571265,"title":"Digimon Adventure: Last Evolution Kizuna","description":"Tai is now a university student, living alone, working hard at school, and working every day, but with his future still undecided. Meanwhile, Matt and others continue to work on Digimon incidents and activities that help people with their partner Digimon. When an unprecedented phenomenon occurs, the DigiDestined discover that when they grow up, their relationship with their partner Digimon will come closer to an end.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2020-02-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pQdZmXq0vvKP1RYUrDHQkzMlS4x.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/22oG48YszCraRJigJw5F6qFs4sR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pQdZmXq0vvKP1RYUrDHQkzMlS4x.jpg","small_pos