 them Pedro, whose morality is gradually corrupted and destroyed by the others.","duration":"1:22:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1950-12-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5jewDz5RxdarX45djYc8kjGa5Ia.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cDCvmYoyqFg4CuSMtGMvCpfOIEw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5jewDz5RxdarX45djYc8kjGa5Ia.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cDCvmYoyqFg4CuSMtGMvCpfOIEw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":832,"title":"M","description":"In this classic German thriller, Hans Beckert, a serial killer who preys on children, becomes the focus of a massive Berlin police manhunt. Beckert''s heinous crimes are so repellant and disruptive to city life that he is even targeted by others in the seedy underworld network. With both cops and criminals in pursuit, the murderer soon realizes that people are on his trail, sending him into a tense, panicked attempt to escape justice.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"1931-05-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5Pk1rGAtyblh9Xaq72T7ARCQSDQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bTdZk3q2DWpBRnLiaaItKFWOVhI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5Pk1rGAtyblh9Xaq72T7ARCQSDQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bTdZk3q2DWpBRnLiaaItKFWOVhI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":381284,"title":"Hidden Figures","description":"The untold story of Katherine G. Johnson, Dorothy Vaughan and Mary Jackson – brilliant African-American women working at NASA and serving as the brains behind one of the greatest operations in history – the launch of astronaut John Glenn into orbit. The visionary trio crossed all gender and race lines to inspire generations to dream big.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2016-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rfk