ond grade, she knows it''s true love. After spending six years trying to convince Bryce the same, she''s ready to give up - until he starts to reconsider.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wdOGA0LC1NiWgAX1OaiKtNA247i.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6zDYFigohwncqFL00MKbFV01dWb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wdOGA0LC1NiWgAX1OaiKtNA247i.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6zDYFigohwncqFL00MKbFV01dWb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29826,"title":"The Legend of the Nahuala","description":"Leo San Juan, an insecure child of nine years old, lives eternally frightened by horror stories that Nando tells his older brother. Within these stories it is ''The Legend of Nahuala'', according to which, an old abandoned Casona is possessed by the spirit of an evil witch known as the Nahuala.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Family","Fantasy","Animation","Horror"],"release_date":"2007-10-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/umAxZQoJ0I6YlwYB5NqLqD7NjdX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dggo1MOieBZsJ18qqqaT4B4VdB4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//umAxZQoJ0I6YlwYB5NqLqD7NjdX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dggo1MOieBZsJ18qqqaT4B4VdB4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":872585,"title":"Oppenheimer","description":"The story of J. Robert Oppenheimer''s role in the development of the atomic bomb during World War II.","duration":"3:01:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2023-07-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/neeNHeXjMF5fXoCJRsOmkNGC7q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8Gxv8gSFCU0XGDykEGv7zR1n2ua.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//neeNHeXjMF5fXoCJRsOmkNGC7q.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8Gx