ascal. Joker. Dreamer. Genius... You''ve never met a college student quite like \"Rancho.\" From the moment he arrives at India''s most prestigious university, Rancho''s outlandish schemes turn the campus upside down—along with the lives of his two newfound best friends. Together, they make life miserable for \"Virus,\" the school’s uptight and heartless dean. But when Rancho catches the eye of the dean''s daughter, Virus sets his sights on flunking out the \"3 idiots\" once and for all.","duration":"2:51:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2009-12-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u7kuUaySqXBVAtqEl9vkTkAzHV9.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/66A9MqXOyVFCssoloscw79z8Tew.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u7kuUaySqXBVAtqEl9vkTkAzHV9.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//66A9MqXOyVFCssoloscw79z8Tew.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":8422,"title":"Rocco and His Brothers","description":"When a impoverished widow’s family moves to the big city, two of her five sons become romantic rivals with deadly results.","duration":"2:58:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Crime"],"release_date":"1960-10-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/26LKQHOk5v7XjUFxm4Pv05nYgln.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pngL8AraChIDOiWnKF2o3S9kJzJ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//26LKQHOk5v7XjUFxm4Pv05nYgln.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pngL8AraChIDOiWnKF2o3S9kJzJ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":673,"title":"Harry Potter and the Prisoner of Azkaban","description":"Harry Potter''s life is in danger once more as dangerous wizard Sirius Black has escaped from Azkaban Prison and is heading to Hogwarts.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2004-05-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vbk5CfaAHOjQPSAcYm6AoRRz2Af.jpg","poster_path":"https://imag