2//gCD0eMZW1pUitLzH93WYWJYQgGk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kDUUdWrbBBVqzSmm27pHFJcTvCU.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":307,"title":"Rome, Open City","description":"During the Nazi occupation of 1944 Rome, Resistance leader Giorgio Manfredi is pursued by the Nazis as he seeks refuge and a means of escape.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"1945-10-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tt1YwEB5UVDKxCYwZEtpNUaDJIi.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ijGV4v8JxgbNzgEhqKdzHdaZn8a.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tt1YwEB5UVDKxCYwZEtpNUaDJIi.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ijGV4v8JxgbNzgEhqKdzHdaZn8a.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":538362,"title":"On My Skin","description":"The incredible true story behind the most controversial Italian court cases in recent years. Stefano Cucchi was arrested for a minor crime and mysteriously found dead during his detention. In one week''s time, a family is changed forever.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2018-09-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lpuehRS74pgVYIQ6ZQ2fIAaoAvo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rwPgE6fLxuJmPWi8fFjgENJMAjr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lpuehRS74pgVYIQ6ZQ2fIAaoAvo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rwPgE6fLxuJmPWi8fFjgENJMAjr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":359724,"title":"Ford v Ferrari","description":"American car designer Carroll Shelby and the British-born driver Ken Miles work together to battle corporate interference, the laws of physics, and their own personal demons to build a revolutionary race car for Ford Motor Company and take on the dominating race cars of Enzo Ferrari at the 24 Hours of Le Mans in France in 1966.","duration":"2:33:00","genre":["Drama","History","Action"],"release_date":"2019-11-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmd