dancer. They fall in love and, when she goes to Milan, Gianni follows her. Informed of this and afraid that their nephew will stop studying, the three Caponi brothers leave for Milan to persuade Gianni to come back and continue studying and abandon the \"Malafemmina\" (bad girl).","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1956-08-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oBBtZHbtLt8wOHemA9Qv8hzcqng.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jHe65nUmr2DBuzEAAkuiFbUssYT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oBBtZHbtLt8wOHemA9Qv8hzcqng.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jHe65nUmr2DBuzEAAkuiFbUssYT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":41391,"title":"Day of Wrath","description":"In a Danish village in the early 1600s, a young woman named Anne, whose mother was thought to be a witch, develops sympathy toward an old woman, Marte, who is accused of witchcraft. The intervention of Anne''s older but kindly husband, Pastor Absalon saved her mother -- but now, urged on by his overbearing mother, he refuses to help Marte. When Absalon''s son returns home and is attracted to Anne, it''s a matter of time before her family destiny catches up with her.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1943-11-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8OYSiDLuSiNA8XcCC9F7MZ80lpw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jEOqbGLFo8fxHHgYoZVTMVYMoQG.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8OYSiDLuSiNA8XcCC9F7MZ80lpw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jEOqbGLFo8fxHHgYoZVTMVYMoQG.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":524,"title":"Casino","description":"In Las Vegas, two best friends--a casino executive and a Mafia enforcer--compete for a gambling empire and a fast-living, fast-loving socialite.","duration":"2:59:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1995-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmd