e before: get jobs.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-03-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/37x8deGuuEiMBEIoe28ulrFsoNn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/40JLnLz5KEQeZnUCKD3zf8sQJFx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//37x8deGuuEiMBEIoe28ulrFsoNn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//40JLnLz5KEQeZnUCKD3zf8sQJFx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1107387,"title":"Hachiko","description":"This is the story of a puppy that touched hundreds of millions of people around the world. Hachiko is a cute Chinese pastoral dog. He met his destined owner Chen Jingxiu in the vast crowd and became a member of the Chen family. With the passage of time, the once beautiful home is no longer there, but Batong is still waiting where it is, and its fate is closely tied to its family.","duration":"2:04:00","genre":["Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2023-03-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sptxlzXJA1t1oWrtAv3t88cKkB2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/whY9rKS8p9Iw2fR2HTF7JAOTcr5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sptxlzXJA1t1oWrtAv3t88cKkB2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//whY9rKS8p9Iw2fR2HTF7JAOTcr5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":388284,"title":"While the Wolf''s Away","description":"A young teen and his misfit group of friends try to escape from a strict boarding school that holds dangerous secrets.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Mystery","Drama","Horror"],"release_date":"2017-02-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ScL5kYz06lt6rvI1dQAZyNbevA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7y2SvYTYQeCNoEEOD26wjr3Nx1N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9ScL5kYz06lt6rvI1dQAZyNbevA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7y2SvYTYQeCNoEEOD26wjr3Nx1N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":862,"title":"Toy Story","description":"Led by Woody, Andy''s toys live happily in his room until Andy''s birthday brings Buzz Lightyear onto the scene. Afraid of losing his place in Andy''s heart, Woody plots against Buzz. But when circumstances separate Buzz and Woody from their owner, the duo eventually learns to put aside their differences.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Family","Comedy","Animation","Adventure"],"release_date":"1995-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Rfvhy1Nl6sSGJwyjb0QiZzZYlB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uXDfjJbdP4ijW5hWSBrPrlKpxab.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Rfvhy1Nl6sSGJwyjb0QiZzZYlB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uXDfjJbdP4ijW5hWSBrPrlKpxab.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":803796,"title":"KPop Demon Hunters","description":"When K-pop superstars Rumi, Mira and Zoey aren''t selling out stadiums, they''re using their secret powers to protect their fans from supernatural threats.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Fantasy","Music","Comedy","Animation"],"release_date":"2025-06-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w3Bi0wygeFQctn6AqFTwhGNXRwL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w3Bi0wygeFQctn6AqFTwhGNXRwL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zT7Lhw3BhJbMkRqm9Zlx2YGMsY0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":400928,"title":"Gifted","description":"Frank, a single man raising his child prodigy niece Mary, is drawn into a custody battle with his mother.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aH63TQfTFgAT8tYZs0CjDsqfMo2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7YB2YrMwIm1g8FyZtlvmVDfRnAT.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aH63TQfTFgAT8tYZs0CjDsqfMo2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7YB2YrMwIm1g8FyZtlvmVDfRnAT.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":13223,"title":"Gran Torino","description":"Disgruntled Korean War veteran Walt Kowalski sets out to reform his neighbor, Thao Lor, a Hmong teenager who tried to steal Kowalski''s prized possession: a 1972 Gran Torino.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2008-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sP4vNXFhPviUJevrD7X8fJV1OD1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zUybYvxWdAJy5hhYovsXtHSWI1l.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sP4vNXFhPviUJevrD7X8fJV1OD1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zUybYvxWdAJy5hhYovsXtHSWI1l.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":553839,"title":"Saga of Tanya the Evil: The Movie","description":"The time is UC 1926. The Imperial Army''s 203rd Air Mage Battalion led by Major Tanya Degurechaff has won the battle to the south against the Republic''s stragglers. They expected to be given a vacation after returning victorious, but instead receive special orders from Staff HQ as soon as they get home. They are told that there were signs of a large-scale deployment near the Empire-Federation border. Faced with the prospect of a new major enemy, the desperate Empire fans the flame of war. Meanwhile, an international volunteer army spearheaded by the Commonwealth set foot in Federation territory. As they say, the enemy of an enemy is your friend. They suffer through misfortune purely out of national interest, and among them is a young girl. She is Warrant Officer Mary Sue, and she takes up arms hoping to bring the Empire, who killed her father, to justice.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Animation","Action","War","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2019-02-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dMcaQp4XfPK11bDeUyj2JOqEY8I.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/omEd5EwOo3LJlGtiiYwEZeCqM3E.jpg","small_backdrop_pat