udios to soap operas, he finally finds success and fame when he becomes \"Bingo\", a TV host clown from one of the audience leader TV shows for children. It turns out that behind the rice powder and red nose, nobody knows who he is.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-08-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/96el06riGUnHRJGXxhP9StZzhFt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/izz36X4Hg7JCei5BOVeXTjVuQzF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//96el06riGUnHRJGXxhP9StZzhFt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//izz36X4Hg7JCei5BOVeXTjVuQzF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":977942,"title":"The Uprising","description":"As war and plague devastate 14th-century England, a humble peasant ignites a rebellion, uniting an army of commoners to defy the King’s might in a desperate fight for justice and survival.","duration":"2:08:00","genre":["Action","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2026-09-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/y0reRTsewsPh0ePtgvDeLIsb5Wk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7TUl15TOsIvndKlgMWTtLgtEzZP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//y0reRTsewsPh0ePtgvDeLIsb5Wk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7TUl15TOsIvndKlgMWTtLgtEzZP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":530915,"title":"1917","description":"At the height of the First World War, two young British soldiers must cross enemy territory and deliver a message that will stop a deadly attack on hundreds of soldiers.","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2019-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2lBOQK06tltt8SQaswgb8d657Mv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iZf0KyrE25z1sage4SYFLCCrMi9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2lBOQK06tltt8SQaswgb8d657Mv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org