l pop culture phenomenon.","duration":"1:39:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2023-03-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yYEOYzgqPB31mkSsuPdCvXH3zHv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a7KyFMPXj0iY4EoLq1PIGU1WJPw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yYEOYzgqPB31mkSsuPdCvXH3zHv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a7KyFMPXj0iY4EoLq1PIGU1WJPw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":30017,"title":"Close-Up","description":"This fiction-documentary hybrid uses a sensational real-life event—the arrest of a young man on charges that he fraudulently impersonated the well-known filmmaker Mohsen Makhmalbaf—as the basis for a stunning, multilayered investigation into movies, identity, artistic creation, and existence, in which the real people from the case play themselves.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Crime","Drama"],"release_date":"1990-05-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3t1qZqP1e17wQshpPKSqII1OogM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m9HG2N9ZKCmNN9qOHJTNyy18wn3.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3t1qZqP1e17wQshpPKSqII1OogM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m9HG2N9ZKCmNN9qOHJTNyy18wn3.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":46592,"title":"Ballad of a Soldier","description":"During World War II, earnest young Russian soldier Alyosha Skvortsov is rewarded with a short leave of absence for performing a heroic deed on the battlefield. Feeling homesick, he decides to visit his mother. Due to his kindhearted nature, however, Alyosha is repeatedly sidetracked by his efforts to help those he encounters, including a lovely girl named Shura. In his tour of a country devastated by war, he struggles to keep hope alive.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","War"],"release_date":"1959-12-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dt580H0MCP5Epuc0sI9TxmtjqnU.jpg","