,"title":"Kill Bill: Vol. 1","description":"An assassin is shot by her ruthless employer, Bill, and other members of their assassination circle – but she lives to plot her vengeance.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Action","Crime"],"release_date":"2003-10-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iffzIhuLAO38Po6sh1s6ZEVwlNL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v7TaX8kXMXs5yFFGR41guUDNcnB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iffzIhuLAO38Po6sh1s6ZEVwlNL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v7TaX8kXMXs5yFFGR41guUDNcnB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":52629,"title":"El Infierno","description":"After being deported back to Mexico, a man has no choice but to join the vicious drug cartel that has corrupted his hometown in order to survive.","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Western","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-09-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bQObbnj0TY2Q1c55w78m1AN6VNX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ar8BpJ5xAzTIw9bqD9Sra6TjBvw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bQObbnj0TY2Q1c55w78m1AN6VNX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ar8BpJ5xAzTIw9bqD9Sra6TjBvw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":780,"title":"The Passion of Joan of Arc","description":"A classic of the silent age, this film tells the story of the doomed but ultimately canonized 15th-century teenage warrior. On trial for claiming she''d spoken to God, Jeanne d''Arc is subjected to inhumane treatment and scare tactics at the hands of church court officials. Initially bullied into changing her story, Jeanne eventually opts for what she sees as the truth. Her punishment, a famously brutal execution, earns her perpetual martyrdom.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1928-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5YyWhr5cgVeYYHbsWjyQ0OGKkmu.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tAgV9yxY6AC1bsPt3qJJQpD4s8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5YyWhr5cgVeYYHbsWjyQ0OGKkmu.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tAgV9yxY6AC1bsPt3qJJQpD4s8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":76,"title":"Before Sunrise","description":"An unexpected meeting on a train leads two travelers to spend an evening wandering through Vienna. As the night unfolds, they share stories and conversations about life and love, exploring new ideas while a quiet intimacy grows between them, knowing it may be their only night together.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1995-01-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qA2TyqPldTtoTVY3LKrNIG5g6bH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kf1Jb1c2JAOqjuzA3H4oDM263uB.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qA2TyqPldTtoTVY3LKrNIG5g6bH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kf1Jb1c2JAOqjuzA3H4oDM263uB.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":503314,"title":"Dragon Ball Super: Broly","description":"Earth is peaceful following the Tournament of Power. Realizing that the universes still hold many more strong people yet to see, Goku spends all his days training to reach even greater heights. Then one day, Goku and Vegeta are faced by a Saiyan called ''Broly'' who they''ve never seen before. The Saiyans were supposed to have been almost completely wiped out in the destruction of Planet Vegeta, so what''s this one doing on Earth? This encounter between the three Saiyans who have followed completely different destinies turns into a stupendous battle, with even Frieza (back from Hell) getting caught up in the mix.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Action","Science Fiction","Animation"],"release_date":"2018-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6OTRuxpwUUGbmCX3MKP25dOmo59.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uMEgkyiPznZP