e befriends a nine-year-old boy and ultimately finds its humanity by unselfishly saving people from their own fears and prejudices.","duration":"1:26:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Family","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"1999-08-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gZ78dyRH9hXeH94ASjuvD9Vw4b5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/k1Cv5CHJvqGWK1xJDUJz8DojFEy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gZ78dyRH9hXeH94ASjuvD9Vw4b5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//k1Cv5CHJvqGWK1xJDUJz8DojFEy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":906126,"title":"Society of the Snow","description":"On October 13, 1972, Uruguayan Air Force Flight 571, chartered to take a rugby team to Chile, crashes into a glacier in the heart of the Andes.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2023-12-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/md848EEPm3dHZOqwGxxTVwH2vu5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2e853FDVSIso600RqAMunPxiZjq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//md848EEPm3dHZOqwGxxTVwH2vu5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2e853FDVSIso600RqAMunPxiZjq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":38286,"title":"Three Men and a Leg","description":"Friends Aldo, Giovanni, and Giacomo cross Italy from north to south for Giacomo''s wedding: the father of the bride, a despotic magnate who is both their boss and father-in-law—since Aldo and Giovanni have also married into the family not for love but for money, a fate now awaiting Giacomo—has entrusted them with a priceless piece of modern art, one that looks just like a rather unremarkable wooden leg.","duration":"1:38:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1997-12-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/43RcFOMa3NGsTw0VUOjkNRmYGbN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yhgfM1WTHu4Uiwa47FAGmBk4V7x.jpg","s