 Movie","description":"After a high school lab experiment goes horribly wrong, Mordecai and Rigby must go back in time to battle an evil volleyball coach in order to save the universe — and their friendship.","duration":"1:09:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"2015-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/An1FS6Baec7uogTcQyEYqruYAtM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p44RoW4naoE1nlSGOqqT0J2pc09.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//An1FS6Baec7uogTcQyEYqruYAtM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p44RoW4naoE1nlSGOqqT0J2pc09.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14836,"title":"Coraline","description":"Wandering her rambling old house in her boring new town, 11-year-old Coraline discovers a hidden door to a strangely idealized version of her life. In order to stay in the fantasy, she must make a frighteningly real sacrifice.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"2009-02-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hofnlIyF6bePkgQOpcuRWLvzf15.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4jeFXQYytChdZYE9JYO7Un87IlW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hofnlIyF6bePkgQOpcuRWLvzf15.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4jeFXQYytChdZYE9JYO7Un87IlW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1050035,"title":"Monster","description":"After an outburst at school involving her son, a concerned single mother demands answers, triggering a sequence of deepening suspicion and turmoil.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Mystery","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2023-06-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dZJcOyRonN0Kb7kJR3DE3esGn16.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kvUJUyUGOhEoiWWNH04IXoExPE2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dZJcOyRonN0Kb7kJR3DE3esGn16.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kvUJUyUGOhEoiWWNH04IXoExPE2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":378108,"title":"In This Corner of the World","description":"Japan, 1943, during World War II. Young Suzu leaves her village near Hiroshima to marry and live with her in-laws in Kure, a military harbor. Her creativity to overcome deprivation quickly makes her indispensable at home. Inhabited by an ancestral wisdom, Suzu impregnates the simple gestures of everyday life with poetry and beauty. The many hardships, the loss of loved ones, the frequent air raids of the enemy, nothing alters her enthusiasm…","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","War","History"],"release_date":"2016-11-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bh5jnK2SeUw7iTbg9QHIi24S01Q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9Z4H4M2F8OQTB04YC1Opds8MFBb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bh5jnK2SeUw7iTbg9QHIi24S01Q.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9Z4H4M2F8OQTB04YC1Opds8MFBb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":37797,"title":"Whisper of the Heart","description":"Shizuku lives a simple life, dominated by her love for stories and writing. One day she notices that all the library books she has have been previously checked out by the same person: \"Seiji Amasawa.\"","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"1995-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rphor0XQcYO4CQoQ6auaQm3UPap.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5FROLD8zpWFs9ja7aYho1uOMJHg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rphor0XQcYO4CQoQ6auaQm3UPap.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5FROLD8zpWFs9ja7aYho1uOMJHg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":81,"title":"Warriors of the Wind","description":"After a global war, the seaside kingdom known as the Valley of the Wind remains one of the last strongholds on Earth untouched by a poisonous jungle an