ildhood and \"SNL,\" eviscerates the value of college and laments getting older in this electric comedy special.","duration":"1:05:00","genre":["Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2018-05-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vDNRa1QAQqExIzmaYpGlkZw1vGL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fERO7sktbElVbGS1SGDKzQJWxtn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vDNRa1QAQqExIzmaYpGlkZw1vGL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fERO7sktbElVbGS1SGDKzQJWxtn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":961,"title":"The General","description":"During America’s Civil War, Union spies steal engineer Johnny Gray''s beloved locomotive, ''The General''—with Johnnie''s lady love aboard an attached boxcar—and he single-handedly must do all in his power to both get The General back and to rescue Annabelle.","duration":"1:19:00","genre":["Comedy","War","Romance"],"release_date":"1926-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mzox4HbcV9W42MH2dB1QsdDVGo3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4NmV1Wei4LxT2lpjViCAScgCZLq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mzox4HbcV9W42MH2dB1QsdDVGo3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4NmV1Wei4LxT2lpjViCAScgCZLq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1000837,"title":"I''m Still Here","description":"A woman married to a former politician during the 1971 military dictatorship in Brazil is forced to reinvent herself and chart a new course for her family after a violent and arbitrary act.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2024-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j9uruwRe9qM8RnP758dF7ISB8Bj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gZnsMbhCvhzAQlKaVpeFRHYjGyb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j9uruwRe9qM8RnP758dF7ISB8Bj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gZnsMbhCvhzAQlK