ure his wife into an affair, but Rosalia proves to be more faithful than he expected.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1961-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u2nPH7STKcz8ddpvxo8Ler1SvPc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vZbdSpUFyFiDBBTY0AiSrN9f303.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u2nPH7STKcz8ddpvxo8Ler1SvPc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vZbdSpUFyFiDBBTY0AiSrN9f303.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11036,"title":"The Notebook","description":"An epic love story centered around an older man who reads aloud to a woman with Alzheimer''s. From a faded notebook, the old man''s words bring to life the story about a couple who is separated by World War II, and is then passionately reunited, seven years later, after they have taken different paths.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2004-06-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zdXnJqBaGFVtLoPNuMeKfEYUViZ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rNzQyW4f8B8cQeg7Dgj3n6eT5k9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zdXnJqBaGFVtLoPNuMeKfEYUViZ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rNzQyW4f8B8cQeg7Dgj3n6eT5k9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16237,"title":"Teen Titans: Trouble in Tokyo","description":"After a battle with a high-tech villain named, Saiko-Tek, the Teen Titans travel to the city of Tokyo where they find themselves embroiled in a conflict with an ancient enemy.","duration":"1:15:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Science Fiction","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2006-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fey7NzJ61KAAVPfUgcpaahW5gZ5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4wMlDE1HzkVyYeDKuY1oDOWQlN2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fey7NzJ61KAAVPfUgcpaahW5gZ5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://