gling salesman takes custody of his son as he''s poised to begin a life-changing professional career.","duration":"1:57:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2006-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5jhG1lTgV0MS6tDkBMQSSitttTT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lBYOKAMcxIvuk9s9hMuecB9dPBV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5jhG1lTgV0MS6tDkBMQSSitttTT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lBYOKAMcxIvuk9s9hMuecB9dPBV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":223,"title":"Rebecca","description":"Story of a young woman who marries a fascinating widower only to find out that she must live in the shadow of his former wife, Rebecca, who died mysteriously several years earlier. The young wife must come to grips with the terrible secret of her handsome, cold husband, Max De Winter. She must also deal with the jealous, obsessed Mrs. Danvers, the housekeeper, who will not accept her as the mistress of the house.","duration":"2:10:00","genre":["Mystery","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"1940-03-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/46p36NyMO6f25YtSqSYiwz4mKbW.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1qz3qUOHnVy7dL7M7G8jSErxE4b.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//46p36NyMO6f25YtSqSYiwz4mKbW.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1qz3qUOHnVy7dL7M7G8jSErxE4b.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":458302,"title":"Remi, Nobody''s Boy","description":"At the age of 10 years, young Rémi is snatched from his adoptive mother and entrusted to the signor Vitalis, a mysterious itinerant musician. Has its hard sides - he will learn the harsh life of acrobat and sing to win his bread. Accompanied by the faithful dog capi and of the small monkey Joli-Coeur, his long trip through France, made for meetings, friendships and mutual assistance, leads him to the secret of its origins.","duration":"1:49:00","genre":["Adventure","Family","Drama"],"release_date":"2018-12-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ufzWHtqmthDV3Vq7LqqDNebq5Cn.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mQYXlxlUTmOP4FWt52qkZZb8JNM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ufzWHtqmthDV3Vq7LqqDNebq5Cn.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mQYXlxlUTmOP4FWt52qkZZb8JNM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":243352,"title":"Where Hope Grows","description":"Calvin Campbell is a former professional baseball player sent to an early retirement due to his panic attacks at the plate. Even though he had all the talent for the big leagues, he struggles with the curveballs life has thrown him. Today, he mindlessly sleepwalks through his days and the challenge of raising his teenager daughter. His life is in a slow downward spiral when it is suddenly awakened and invigorated by the most unlikely person – Produce, a young-man with Down syndrome who works at the local grocery store.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-04-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fLJUO27NcQymwcBkNX4Na8NNk64.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gQmOsU2hA0PrGvxGjzty1S2OO3H.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fLJUO27NcQymwcBkNX4Na8NNk64.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gQmOsU2hA0PrGvxGjzty1S2OO3H.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":47796,"title":"Mamma Roma","description":"After years spent working as a prostitute in her Italian village, middle-aged Mamma Roma has saved enough money to buy herself a fruit stand so that she can have a respectable middle-class life and reestablish contact with the 16-year-old son she abandoned when he was an infant. But her former pimp threatens to expose her sordid past, and her troubled son seems destined to fall into a life of crime and violence.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1962-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4OqoSolfhNesDAfv2zluIDVXiPR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kQtO9rzEhcezWl0nQlIxV2FZftt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4OqoSolfhNesDAfv2zluIDVXiPR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kQtO9rzEhcezWl0nQlIxV2FZftt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":833,"title":"Umberto D.","description":"When elderly pensioner Umberto Domenico Ferrari returns to his boarding house from a protest calling for a hike in old-age pensions, his landlady demands her 15,000-lire rent by the end of the month or he and his small dog will be turned out onto the street. Unable to get the money in time, Umberto fakes illness to get sent to a hospital, giving his beloved dog to the landlady''s pregnant and abandoned maid for temporary safekeeping.","duration":"1:31:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1952-01-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dop0CEPeeW3BXDUGL1oDt9ywgK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5I7SYsNQmZRZpQ2MAarIQYU9vaX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dop0CEPeeW3BXDUGL1oDt9ywgK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5I7SYsNQmZRZpQ2MAarIQYU9vaX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":505262,"title":"My Hero Academia: Two Heroes","description":"All Might and Deku accept an invitation to go abroad to a floating and mobile manmade city, called ''I-Island'', where they research quirks as well as hero supplemental items at the special ''I-Expo'' convention that is currently being held on the island. During that time, suddenly, despite an iron wall of security surrounding the island, the system is breached by a villain, and the only ones able to stop him are the students of Class 1-A.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2018-08-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b9qGMCOrMbxUjD6xDAYPoIPnYcC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hC4nTxdhXqFWzgqynGvvXVMiMNp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b9qGMCOrMbxUjD6xDAYPoIPnYcC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hC4nTxdhXqFWzgqynGvvXVMiMNp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":404378,"title":"A Street Cat Named Bob","description":"James Bowen, a homeless busker and recovering drug addict, has his life transformed when he meets a stray ginger cat.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Family","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3YDuN1mhQpYtCym4QatX0gkHahL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nBYG0D2FcbL1m926sIj7RN4m0sb.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3YDuN1mhQpYtCym4QatX0gkHahL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nBYG0D2FcbL1m926sIj7RN4m0sb.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":69335,"title":"Estômago: A Gastronomic Story","description":"In a dog-eat-dog world, Raimundo Nonato has found an alternative way to move ahead: he cooks. No matter what social strata this deceptively innocent young man inhabits, he hones his skills and sharpens his knives—and then he falls in love. Jorge''s nimble comic fable provides a smartly constructed gastronomic allegory for ambition and survival.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy","Mystery","Crime"],"release_date":"2008-04-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Os2EXMHcV9EkO0PWNIvT4phksL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mo9utQQ9nurl2ELWUzS4e3WHGDm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Os2EXMHcV9EkO0PWNIvT4phksL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mo9utQQ9nurl2ELWUzS4e3WHGDm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15383,"title":"Army of Shadows","description":"Betrayed by an informant, Philippe Gerbier finds himself trapped in a torturous Nazi prison camp. Though Gerbier escapes to rejoin the Resistance in occupied Marseilles, France, and exacts his re