ackdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2reDfi3bl3givTawULOVvjEF1rR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//omKzydOrom9kpdfQUE0G9Y9sPl0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":51482,"title":"Death Note Relight 1: Visions of a God","description":"When rogue shinigami Ryuk leaves his Death Note in the human world, he has no idea how far the one who finds it will take his new-found power. With the Death Note in hand, brilliant high school student Light Yagami vows to rid the world of evil. A recap of Death Note episodes 1–26, with alternate footage.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["TV Movie","Crime","Drama","Fantasy","Thriller","Animation"],"release_date":"2007-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lyQCUSslaE8fe4CHHKwXvTeudQf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hNd4F5MzXcRJ35go07Ozbw3KUw2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lyQCUSslaE8fe4CHHKwXvTeudQf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hNd4F5MzXcRJ35go07Ozbw3KUw2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":32015,"title":"I Am Cuba","description":"A study in contrasts set in and around Havana that explores Cuba''s 1959 revolution: a young woman''s fascination with the excess of an American-owned casino leads to her downfall in the eyes of her street vendor boyfriend; a tenant farmer revolts the only way he knows how, attacking the land he works; university students gain first-hand knowledge of political upheaval; and, in the hills outside the city, the members of a poor peasant family are patriotically swept up into the burgeoning revolt.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1964-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cLKNGx0bFpbtsVOXeaXJw3dNcKQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qQxv27Lae6Uph7iOEzyZ5BOZxJh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cLKNGx0bFpbtsVOXeaXJw3dNcKQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qQxv27Lae6Uph7iOEzyZ5BOZxJh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29455,"title":"Winter Light","description":"A Swedish pastor fails a loving woman, a suicidal fisherman and God.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1963-02-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tis6nrWakUsuG6Jwdm4yESfTU0o.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wDxrEssdjFWYwIZLbr06RQNcg1q.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tis6nrWakUsuG6Jwdm4yESfTU0o.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wDxrEssdjFWYwIZLbr06RQNcg1q.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2011,"title":"Persepolis","description":"In 1970s Iran, Marjane ''Marji'' Satrapi watches events through her young eyes and her idealistic family of a long dream being fulfilled of the hated Shah''s defeat in the Iranian Revolution of 1979. However as Marji grows up, she witnesses first hand how the new Iran, now ruled by Islamic fundamentalists, has become a repressive tyranny on its own.","duration":"1:35:00","genre":["Animation","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-06-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4pfb85bv0rKkmslTp2hzAqA7RT4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aU8i2QAdTyRR1nYb36Gq51xXP8p.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4pfb85bv0rKkmslTp2hzAqA7RT4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aU8i2QAdTyRR1nYb36Gq51xXP8p.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":775,"title":"A Trip to the Moon","description":"Professor Barbenfouillis and five of his colleagues from the Academy of Astronomy travel to the Moon aboard a rocket propelled by a giant cannon. Once on the lunar surface, the bold explorers face the many perils hidden in the caves of the mysterious planet.","duration":"0:15:00","genre":["Adventure","Science Fiction","Comedy"],"release_date":"1902-06-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/g67r1eiQD3ERSEQFCFkSn7TeGw5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9o0v5LLFk51nyTBHZSre6OB37n2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//g67r1eiQD3ERSEQFCFkSn7TeGw5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9o0v5LLFk51nyTBHZSre6OB37n2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1214484,"title":"Let Go","description":"A jaded mother makes a last-ditch effort to keep her family together by taking them on a trip to their teenage daughter’s pole dancing competition.","duration":"1:50:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2024-11-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lk2V8WFnAoXa44q8vqVeYyK6WJK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hIJRqqAaMUtQ13mZL6lCE6myhXH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lk2V8WFnAoXa44q8vqVeYyK6WJK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hIJRqqAaMUtQ13mZL6lCE6myhXH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":488623,"title":"Forgotten","description":"Jin-seok, 21-year-old, moves into a new house with his family. He suffers from a slight schizophrenia but he carries an ordinary life under the warm care of the family. His older brother Yu-seok is a decent college student, a mentor, and role model for Jin-seok.  One night, his beloved brother is kidnapped by unidentified assailants before Jin-seok''s eye. Jin-seok can’t recognize their faces, but can remember only the VIN that matches with no car. After long silence of 19 days, suddenly Yu-seok returns home, but remembers nothing which had happened in the meantime. And soon Jin-seok feels Yu-seok is a total stranger.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Thriller","Mystery","Crime"],"release_date":"2017-11-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tGFII2hY0O0qXPAPGE1fBDOONQJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cBgj41y1RvmW1zJCEX0uNWL0UjW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tGFII2hY0O0qXPAPGE1fBDOONQJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cBgj41y1RvmW1zJCEX0uNWL0UjW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":393,"title":"Kill Bill: Vol. 2","description":"The Bride unwaveringly continues on her roaring rampage of revenge against the band of assassins who had tried to kill her and her unborn child. She visits each of her former associates one-by-one, checking off the victims on her Death List Five until there''s nothing left to do … but kill Bill.","duration":"2:16:00","genre":["Action","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2004-04-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pgG6tzJzC8mjGqhaT8IWwEk00xf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2yhg0mZQMhDyvUQ4rG1IZ4oIA8L.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pgG6tzJzC8mjGqhaT8IWwEk00xf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2yhg0mZQMhDyvUQ4rG1IZ4oIA8L.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":827,"title":"Diabolique","description":"The cruel and abusive headmaster of a boarding school, Michel Delassalle, is murdered by an unlikely duo -- his meek wife and the mistress he brazenly flaunts. The women become increasingly unhinged by a series of odd occurrences after Delassalle''s corpse mysteriously disappears.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"1955-01-29","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rcEUuRtr0dFL078bNeXL8pQqrMK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jE8ygUYBUGyUcM4sR6iinPqYeDK.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rcEUuRtr0dFL078bNeXL8pQqrMK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jE8ygUYBUGyUcM4sR6iinPqYeDK.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":573164,"title":"An Egg Rescue","description":"Toto and his friends must rescue his egg children after they''re taken away for a gourmet food event in Africa.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"2021-08-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sIMyHMcbFR1jeQ8OC1Y2b93EhXN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_