.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c7VbRPlev1bRfKvTxr98erw5T7B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wFSpyMsp7H0ttERbxY7Trlv8xry.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c7VbRPlev1bRfKvTxr98erw5T7B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wFSpyMsp7H0ttERbxY7Trlv8xry.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":667520,"title":"A Whisker Away","description":"A peculiar girl transforms into a cat to catch her crush''s attention. But before she realizes it, the line between human and animal starts to blur.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Romance","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2020-06-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eHTZoXmB4vnDqANZXPZcdAiYQo5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6inkRM1XGBG5vRhclCPWfMenp7N.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eHTZoXmB4vnDqANZXPZcdAiYQo5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6inkRM1XGBG5vRhclCPWfMenp7N.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":582927,"title":"I''m No Longer Here","description":"In Monterrey, Mexico, a young street gang spends their days dancing to slowed-down cumbia and attending parties. After a mix-up with a local cartel, their leader is forced to migrate to the U.S. but quickly longs to return home.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-10-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wFSXN4CaDfmUURbEbghhK6m7WPI.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AtfK71xkVaaHTZwU5mgfDgBqg9Y.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wFSXN4CaDfmUURbEbghhK6m7WPI.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AtfK71xkVaaHTZwU5mgfDgBqg9Y.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":369557,"title":"Sing Street","description":"A boy growing up in Dublin during the 1980s escapes his strained family life by starting a band to impress the mysterious girl he likes.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Music","Comedy"],"release