cy. His life takes a nightmarish turn and he soon finds himself on a painful and harrowing journey of self-discovery.","duration":"2:15:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2001-12-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hCJFWTPghXCwwSpvPpAoIB8318Q.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rEIg5yJdNOt9fmX4P8gU9LeNoTQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hCJFWTPghXCwwSpvPpAoIB8318Q.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rEIg5yJdNOt9fmX4P8gU9LeNoTQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":316029,"title":"The Greatest Showman","description":"The story of American showman P.T. Barnum, founder of the circus that became the famous traveling Ringling Bros. and Barnum & Bailey Circus.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2017-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lrNKm3HNvGdZoAfiBKu7b04FLHN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/b9CeobiihCx1uG1tpw8hXmpi7nm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lrNKm3HNvGdZoAfiBKu7b04FLHN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//b9CeobiihCx1uG1tpw8hXmpi7nm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":3112,"title":"The Night of the Hunter","description":"In Depression-era West Virginia, a serial-killing preacher hunts two young children who know the whereabouts of a stash of money.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1955-07-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7cVEnb4Pth3STa7YfVOk9RtzDLB.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rBka0nFWiHxabHRLr0KfIA8Yiaq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7cVEnb4Pth3STa7YfVOk9RtzDLB.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rBka0nFWiHxabHRLr0KfIA8Yiaq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":662,"title":"La Jetée","description":"A man confronts his past during an experiment that attempts to find a solution to the problems of a