akes up an interest in the techno trousers created by Wallace. However, Gromit later learns that the penguin is a wanted criminal.","duration":"0:30:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"1993-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9AbessEz2YKjmPtYKATDeYRW3Px.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mV8SDTjkxrDxu0a0egvFz1lRPU7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9AbessEz2YKjmPtYKATDeYRW3Px.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mV8SDTjkxrDxu0a0egvFz1lRPU7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":30969,"title":"Louis C.K.: Chewed Up","description":"Profane, vulgar and obscenely funny, Louis C.K. insists on telling the truth, whether you like it or not! Join the Emmy Award-winning stand-up comic and TV star (Lucky Louie) as he shares his thoughts on the stuff everyone thinks about -- male bodily fluids, the joys of being white, the difference between women and girls -- but never has the nerve to say. It''s Louis C.K. at his risk-taking best: fearless, honest and totally outrageous! Nominated for the 2009 Emmy for Outstanding Writing for a Variety, Music or Comedy Special","duration":"1:00:00","genre":["Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2008-10-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/miFsgaP3u8CKiwQ0aSMrefNnM7R.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jJpTrCHb4ETP2zzjA5RQgJHBxed.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//miFsgaP3u8CKiwQ0aSMrefNnM7R.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jJpTrCHb4ETP2zzjA5RQgJHBxed.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":581,"title":"Dances with Wolves","description":"Wounded Civil War soldier John Dunbar tries to commit suicide—and becomes a hero instead. As a reward, he''s assigned to his dream post, a remote junction on the Western frontier, and soon makes unlikely friends with the local Sioux tribe.","duration":"3:01:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama","Western"],"release_date":"1990-11-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ywWva4trKw7f3wtbz81Fe3FnrtC.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hw0ZEHAaTqTxSXGVwUFX7uvanSA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ywWva4trKw7f3wtbz81Fe3FnrtC.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hw0ZEHAaTqTxSXGVwUFX7uvanSA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22,"title":"Pirates of the Caribbean: The Curse of the Black Pearl","description":"When wily pirate Captain Barbossa seizes Jack Sparrow’s beloved ship, the Black Pearl, and kidnaps the governor’s daughter, Elizabeth Swann, blacksmith Will Turner reluctantly teams up with the unpredictable pirate Jack to rescue her—only to uncover a terrifying curse that turns Barbossa’s crew into the undead.","duration":"2:23:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy","Action"],"release_date":"2003-07-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uRNgkJSkNBFbbn9fPsEjDIy8Sh3.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/poHwCZeWzJCShH7tOjg8RIoyjcw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uRNgkJSkNBFbbn9fPsEjDIy8Sh3.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//poHwCZeWzJCShH7tOjg8RIoyjcw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":1304313,"title":"Lee Cronin''s The Mummy","description":"The young daughter of a journalist disappears into the desert without a trace—eight years later, the broken family is shocked when she is returned to them, as what should be a joyful reunion turns into a living nightmare.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Horror","Mystery"],"release_date":"2026-04-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xugEpZk9YQ0DIz1aFvH5HGkqpZK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1q308iixueCU4pFtSYugNOevtNx.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xugEpZk9YQ0DIz1aFvH5HGkqpZK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1q308iixueCU4pFtSYugNOevtNx.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":152601,"title":"Her","description":"In the not so distant future, Theodore, a lonely writer, purchases a newly developed operating system designed to meet the user''s every need. To Theodore''s surprise, a romantic relationship develops between him and his operating system. This unconventional love story blends science fiction and romance in a sweet tale that explores the nature of love and the ways that technology isolates and connects us all.","duration":"2:06:00","genre":["Romance","Science Fiction","Drama"],"release_date":"2013-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1YnZchmaGc8dchgRPDpR1KGrixA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eCOtqtfvn7mxGl6nfmq4b1exJRc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1YnZchmaGc8dchgRPDpR1KGrixA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eCOtqtfvn7mxGl6nfmq4b1exJRc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":235,"title":"Stand by Me","description":"After learning that a boy their age has been accidentally killed near their rural homes, four boys decide to go see the body. Gordie, Vern, Chris, and Teddy encounter a mean junk man and a marsh full of leeches, but they also learn more about one another and their very different home lives. Just a lark at first, the boys'' adventure evolves into a defining event in their lives.","duration":"1:29:00","genre":["Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"1986-08-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yjGllQUm28R4X9xD9T5xMszirgw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vz0w9BSehcqjDcJOjRaCk7fgJe7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yjGllQUm28R4X9xD9T5xMszirgw.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vz0w9BSehcqjDcJOjRaCk7fgJe7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":93,"title":"Anatomy of a Murder","description":"Semi-retired Michigan lawyer Paul Biegler takes the case of Army Lt. Manion, who murdered a local innkeeper after his wife claimed that he raped her. 