yles form a surprising weapon, but can their newfound teamwork defeat their rival Nekoma High in the highly anticipated ''Dumpster Battle'', the long awaited ultimate showdown between two opposing underdog teams?","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy"],"release_date":"2024-02-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cZmOrIOkJ2SNfVdiO85dUbOAYnL.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ntRU0OA4etGGiMMmH1Yw0bnaMdW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cZmOrIOkJ2SNfVdiO85dUbOAYnL.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ntRU0OA4etGGiMMmH1Yw0bnaMdW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":761898,"title":"Sword Art Online the Movie - Progressive - Aria of a Starless Night","description":"Asuna Yuuki had never played online games until accidentally putting on the NerveGear for Sword Art Online, the world’s first VRMMORPG. She soon finds herself and other players trapped inside a game, where if a player dies in the game, they die in the real world. As she continues to live on in this world where death is always a step away, a solitary swordsman named Kirito appears before her.","duration":"1:37:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2021-10-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qKVOTKPPtvoXd75L1HOSBPLtKWS.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yD9RhgIVydQNBK7OLEbCWYcWMUd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qKVOTKPPtvoXd75L1HOSBPLtKWS.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yD9RhgIVydQNBK7OLEbCWYcWMUd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":698948,"title":"Thirteen Lives","description":"Based on the true nail-biting mission that captivated the world. Twelve boys and the coach of a Thai soccer team explore the Tham Luang cave when an unexpected rainstorm traps them in a chamber inside the mountain. Entombed behind a maze of flooded cave tunnels, they face impossible odds. A team of world-class divers navigate through miles of dangerous cave networks to discover that finding the boys is only the beginning.","duration":"2:27:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","History"],"release_date":"2022-07-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tHR34A5n0my4maACNdLpWGd6QYq.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yi5KcJqFxy0D6yP8nCfcF8gJGg5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tHR34A5n0my4maACNdLpWGd6QYq.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yi5KcJqFxy0D6yP8nCfcF8gJGg5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":379170,"title":"Sherlock: The Abominable Bride","description":"Sherlock Holmes and Dr. Watson find themselves in 1890s London in this holiday special.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Mystery","Thriller","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2016-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gGeoc8rFfPRIakXNttoFU85YVwv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hibE8cyZs2Bm0o4WaWd1pppvjO2.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gGeoc8rFfPRIakXNttoFU85YVwv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hibE8cyZs2Bm0o4WaWd1pppvjO2.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2440,"title":"Joint Security Area","description":"Two North Korean soldiers are killed in the border area between North and South Korea, prompting an investigation by a neutral body. The lead investigator (Lee Young-ae) receives differing accounts from the two sides.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","Thriller","Mystery"],"release_date":"2000-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z7w6ACQJTeGYASr1plSwfRe6Ytk.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lTpdrei4eWsEsCi4tYYKwdYCFxw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z7w6ACQJTeGYASr1plSwfRe6Ytk.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lTpdrei4eWsEsCi4tYYKwdYCFxw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":107,"title":"Snatch","description":"Unscrupulous boxing promoters, violent bookies, a Russian gangster, incompetent amateur robbers, and supposedly Jewish jewellers fight to track down a priceless stolen diamond.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Crime","Comedy"],"release_date":"2000-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/gTghF8ardwJ48XLHkiapWk3ZmSo.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kJZoAHq1SLDdWjeNGtlHAnGpmFV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//gTghF8ardwJ48XLHkiapWk3ZmSo.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kJZoAHq1SLDdWjeNGtlHAnGpmFV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":505192,"title":"Shoplifters","description":"In the outskirts of Tokyo, a poor but close-knit group living on the fringes of society survives through shoplifting and odd jobs. When Osamu and his son take in a neglected young girl, their already fragile existence begins to unravel. As the family grows attached to her, buried secrets surface, forcing them to confront the true meaning of love, belonging, and what makes a family.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Thriller"],"release_date":"2018-06-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dVRkhmtDn3EiyhX6c9SfL7klCoU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4nfRUOv3LX5zLn98WS1WqVBk9E9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dVRkhmtDn3EiyhX6c9SfL7klCoU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4nfRUOv3LX5zLn98WS1WqVBk9E9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":571391,"title":"Chicuarotes","description":"Cagalera and Moloteco are two teenagers from San Gregorio Atlapulco who are desperate to get out and move up and away from oppressive circumstances. When they hear of an opportunity to buy a spot in the electrician’s union, which could transform their lives, they quickly devolve into the criminal, adult underworld of Mexico City in a bid to buy their freedom.","duration":"1:36:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2019-06-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/keWxkQoYWeEINYbdI8rye4oHCbP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vN43s4gcqANLuVn5ImuTyb673iz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//keWxkQoYWeEINYbdI8rye4oHCbP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vN43s4gcqANLuVn5ImuTyb673iz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16,"title":"Dancer in the Dark","description":"Selma, a Czech immigrant on the verge of blindness, struggles to make ends meet for herself and her young son, who has inherited the same genetic disorder and will suffer the same fate without an expensive operation. When life becomes increasingly difficult, Selma learns to cope through her love of musicals, dreaming up little numbers to the rhythmic beats of her surroundings.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2000-09-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vxvzf0cGtFY2Vpw5ULWumCIW6Ri.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pWzOfTJRZHPNO1VNrMnNFqRcJwg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vxvzf0cGtFY2Vpw5ULWumCIW6Ri.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pWzOfTJRZHPNO1VNrMnNFqRcJwg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":677638,"title":"We Bare Bears: The Movie","description":"When Grizz, Panda, and Ice Bear''s love of food trucks and viral videos get out of hand, the brothers are now chased away from their home and embark on a trip to Canada, where they can live in peace.","duration":"1:09:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Family","Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2020-06-30","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pO1SnM5a1fEsYrFaVZW78Wb0zRJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/khtIr0Gxtz52T10RRQZ42o1a5Ry.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pO1SnM5a1fEsYrFaVZW78Wb0zRJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//khtIr0Gxtz52T10RRQZ42o1a5Ry.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":52345,"title":"Lisbela and the Prisoner","description":"Lisbela is a young woman who loves going to the movies. Leléu is a con man, going from town to town selling all sort of things and performing as master of ceremonies for some cheesy numbers, such as the woman who gets transformed into a gorilla. He gets involved with Linaura, a sexy and beautiful woman who happens to be the wife of the most frightening hitman of the place. The hitman finds out his wife''s affair and goes after Leléu, who has to leave in a hurry. In another town, he meets and falls instantly in love with Lisbela, who is engaged to Douglas, a hillbilly who tries hard to pass for a cosmopolitan Rio de Janeiro dweller.","duration":"1:46:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"2003-08-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eAOOeqa14oCxgdKxLvpDYxCJhqQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/raCdo5Hjpd3uXbpSd1JZ7tEyE31.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eAOOeqa14oCxgdKxLvpDYxCJhqQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//raCdo5Hjpd3uXbpSd1JZ7tEyE31.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10315,"title":"Fantastic Mr. Fox","description":"The Fantastic Mr. Fox, bored with his current life, plans a heist against the three local farmers. The farmers, tired of sharing their chickens with the sly fox, seek revenge against him and his family.","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Adventure","Animation","Comedy","Family"],"release_date":"2009-10-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xRxSLhhjPG2D8l0BXi0KdN4IvPt.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bOVr292mwn3jxr1e0NmUPM1rcjo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xRxSLhhjPG2D8l0BXi0KdN4IvPt.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bOVr292mwn3jxr1e0NmUPM1rcjo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":944401,"title":"Dogman","description":"A boy, bruised by life, finds his salvation through the love of his dogs.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Action","Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"2023-09-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nvW0QfRJ7ga9TK8DKwBfAPA8ywP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5RuUD7J4vO0El7TRL9guZIik0I0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nvW0QfRJ7ga9TK8DKwBfAPA8ywP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5RuUD7J4vO0El7TRL9guZIik0I0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":911430,"title":"F1","description":"Racing legend Sonny Hayes is coaxed out of retirement to lead a struggling Formula 1 team—and mentor a young hotshot driver—while chasing one more chance at glory.","duration":"2:36:00","genre":["Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2025-06-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lkDYN0whyE82mcM20rwtwjbniKF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9PXZIUsSDh4alB80jheWX4fhZmy.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lkDYN0whyE82mcM20rwtwjbniKF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9PXZIUsSDh4alB80jheWX4fhZmy.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":80379,"title":"Louis C.K.: Live at the Beacon Theater","description":"Recorded November 10th, 2011 as part of the New York Comedy Festival, and only available for purchase online, Louis C.K. follows up his 2010 concert film Hilarious with a new hour’s worth of shrewdly observed and periodically profane material. He starts with making his own kind of please-turn-off-your-cell-phone announcement, as well as a warning not to text or tweet during the show: “Just live your life,” he asks. Whether he’s talking about a unique way to drop a rental car off at an airport or describing why a man in his 40s should not smoke dope, it’s terrific, humane, carried-to-crazed-extremes stuff.","duration":"1:02:00","genre":["Comedy","TV Movie"],"release_date":"2011-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lJxtMpsFyWINiXqV0ZW0LgwtAWE.jpg","poster_p