er lonely twelve-year-old-daughter to her rural hometown but the horrors of war soon catch up with them.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Drama","War"],"release_date":"1960-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3TcUsPiVU0fSLX0Mk7lc3DDuzkY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/biWDAUQD58enMEcyO2BqIVSycF4.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3TcUsPiVU0fSLX0Mk7lc3DDuzkY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//biWDAUQD58enMEcyO2BqIVSycF4.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14574,"title":"The Boy in the Striped Pyjamas","description":"When his family moves from their home in Berlin to a strange new house in Poland, young Bruno befriends Shmuel, a boy who lives on the other side of the fence where everyone seems to be wearing striped pajamas. Unaware of Shmuel''s fate as a Jewish prisoner or the role his own Nazi father plays in his imprisonment, Bruno embarks on a dangerous journey inside the camp''s walls.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Drama","War","History"],"release_date":"2008-05-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6aRuABAdhuuDypLGscM7HoEWHx4.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2C8QCXdMlojTxZjfBlINr4FWcb6.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6aRuABAdhuuDypLGscM7HoEWHx4.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2C8QCXdMlojTxZjfBlINr4FWcb6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10193,"title":"Toy Story 3","description":"Woody, Buzz, and the rest of Andy''s toys haven''t been played with in years. With Andy about to go to college, the gang find themselves accidentally left at a nefarious day care center. The toys must band together to escape and return home to Andy.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy"],"release_date":"2010-06-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wE5JGzujfvDPMIfFjJyrhXFjZLc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AbbXspMOwdvwWZgVN0nabZq03Ec.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wE5JGzujfvDPMIfFjJyrhXFjZLc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AbbXspMOwdvwWZgVN0nabZq03Ec.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5801,"title":"Pather Panchali","description":"Impoverished priest Harihar Ray, dreaming of a better life for himself and his family, leaves his rural Bengal village in search of work. Alone, his wife, Sarbojaya, looks after her rebellious daughter, Durga, and her young son, Apu, as well as Harihar''s elderly aunt Indir. The children enjoy the small pleasures of their difficult life, while their parents suffer the daily indignities heaped upon them.","duration":"2:05:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1955-08-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wadoNHCMPElgYuOqLxqDQqXpTMx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/frZj5djlU9hFEjMcL21RJZVuG5O.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wadoNHCMPElgYuOqLxqDQqXpTMx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//frZj5djlU9hFEjMcL21RJZVuG5O.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":522402,"title":"Finch","description":"On a post-apocalyptic Earth, a robot, built to protect the life of his dying creator''s beloved dog, learns about life, love, friendship, and what it means to be human.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Drama","Adventure"],"release_date":"2021-11-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uoc358GH6Yl7TufbUKHkETPu64B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eEJtzD1F05xDipFEDY98CTH5yZn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uoc358GH6Yl7TufbUKHkETPu64B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eEJtzD1F05xDipFEDY98CTH5yZn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":826,"title":"The Bridge on the River Kwai","description":"The classic story of English POWs in Burma forced to build a bridge to aid the war effort of their Japanese captors. British and American intelligence officers conspire to blow up the structure, but Col. Nicholson, the commander who supervised the bridge''s construction, has acquired a sense of pride in his creation and tries to foil their plans.","duration":"2:42:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1957-10-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cGi9obHiooPoNR4JX72L9RooeOY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7paXMt2e3Tr5dLmEZOGgFEn2Vo7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//cGi9obHiooPoNR4JX72L9RooeOY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7paXMt2e3Tr5dLmEZOGgFEn2Vo7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":562,"title":"Die Hard","description":"High above the city of L.A. a team of terrorists has seized a building, taken hostages, and declared war. One man has manages to escape... An off-duty cop hiding somewhere inside. He''s alone, tired... and the only chance anyone has got.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"1988-07-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/bvk2AAH64lP2YZs02Q3jskfHT8j.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7Bjd8kfmDSOzpmhySpEhkUyK2oH.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//bvk2AAH64lP2YZs02Q3jskfHT8j.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7Bjd8kfmDSOzpmhySpEhkUyK2oH.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11953,"title":"Kagemusha","description":"A feudal epic presenting the tale of a petty thief who is recruited to impersonate Shingen, an aging warlord, in order to avoid attacks by competing clans. The impostor becomes comfortable living his life among nobility, but his responsibilities to his station grow more demanding the longer he occupies it.","duration":"3:00:00","genre":["Action","Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"1980-04-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7qsKE8GsgjreeQ2mTLd5oKZ7Tbf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w60