m the messiness of human relationships. When appointed by the beautiful but emotionally damaged Claire to oversee the valuation and sale of her family’s priceless art collection, Virgil allows himself to form an attachment to her – and soon he is engulfed by a passion which will rock his bland existence to the core.","duration":"2:11:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Crime"],"release_date":"2013-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4EdN5rIT43xcqi4IVRrhxiDOz6z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ibDGPgUZn6vxHiSgt2xeQyFp8Np.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4EdN5rIT43xcqi4IVRrhxiDOz6z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ibDGPgUZn6vxHiSgt2xeQyFp8Np.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11049,"title":"Interstella 5555: The 5tory of the 5ecret 5tar 5ystem","description":"Four talented alien musicians are kidnapped by a record producer who disguises them as humans. Shep, a space pilot in love with bass player Stella, follows them to Earth. Reprogrammed to forget their real identities and renamed The Crescendolls, the group quickly becomes a huge success playing soulless corporate pop. At a concert, Shep manages to free all the musicians except Stella, and the band sets out to rediscover who they really are — and to rescue Stella.","duration":"1:08:00","genre":["Animation","Science Fiction","Music","Adventure"],"release_date":"2003-05-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eDso5UEr3nnA1SYPH3aVDsjE09I.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AsvPgdcSlHocAbMp3yGZXjPiKKF.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eDso5UEr3nnA1SYPH3aVDsjE09I.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AsvPgdcSlHocAbMp3yGZXjPiKKF.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":2118,"title":"L.A. Confidential","description":"Three detectives in the corrupt and brutal L.A. police force of the 1950s use differing methods to uncover a conspiracy behind the shotgun slayings of the patrons at an all-night diner.","duration":"2:18:00","genre":["Crime","Mystery","Thriller"],"release_date":"1997-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hUn13Hom8OWMYpR1ay0diwswwdP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lWCgf5sD5FpMljjpkRhcC8pXcch.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hUn13Hom8OWMYpR1ay0diwswwdP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lWCgf5sD5FpMljjpkRhcC8pXcch.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":200727,"title":"Love, Rosie","description":"Since the moment they met at age 5, Rosie and Alex have been best friends, facing the highs and lows of growing up side by side. A fleeting shared moment, one missed opportunity, and the decisions that follow send their lives in completely different directions. As each navigates the complexities of life, love, and everything in between, they always find their way back to each other - but is it just friendship, or something more?","duration":"1:42:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2014-10-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rpsHpJj7FgnNBXhaO2KFthPwqH6.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2HOd431LX9ggqSpBIJ7qyYhATyo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rpsHpJj7FgnNBXhaO2KFthPwqH6.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2HOd431LX9ggqSpBIJ7qyYhATyo.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":80,"title":"Before Sunset","description":"Nine years later, Jesse travels across Europe giving readings from a book he wrote about the night he spent in Vienna with Celine. After his reading in Paris, Celine finds him, and they spend part of the day together before Jesse has to again leave for a flight. They are both in relationships now, and Jesse has a son, but as their strong feelings for each other start to return, both confess a longing for more.","duration":"1:20:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2004-06-16","