d his family kicked out of their farm due to foreclosure. He catches up with them on his Uncle’s farm, and joins them the next day as they head for California and a new life... Hopefully.","duration":"2:09:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1940-03-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/r7AcmVk6kGhdFdesViGaI3dEHWd.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eUcxMVBIA0Jg8l1RGUqycrc3eIQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//r7AcmVk6kGhdFdesViGaI3dEHWd.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eUcxMVBIA0Jg8l1RGUqycrc3eIQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":83564,"title":"La luna","description":"A young boy comes of age in the most peculiar of circumstances. Tonight is the very first time his Papa and Grandpa are taking him to work. In an old wooden boat they row far out to sea, and with no land in sight, they stop and wait. A big surprise awaits the boy as he discovers his family''s most unusual line of work. Should he follow the example of his Papa, or his Grandpa? Will he be able to find his own way in the midst of their conflicting opinions and timeworn traditions?","duration":"0:07:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2012-02-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yJAQSaH6L2TIpF23ojGiBxtbVJJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9euW64JUgFlA7fxN8lAmwK6gUaQ.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yJAQSaH6L2TIpF23ojGiBxtbVJJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9euW64JUgFlA7fxN8lAmwK6gUaQ.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":301,"title":"Rio Bravo","description":"A small-town sheriff in the American West enlists the help of a disabled man, a drunk, and a young gunfighter in his efforts to hold in jail the brother of the local bad guy.","duration":"2:21:00","genre":["Western","Drama"],"release_date":"1959-03-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/38uM6QuI06znUCELfOSiVQy05CX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4gI4KKmoi0d3yfsF71YU3S0I5t8.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//38uM6QuI06znUCELfOSiVQy05CX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4gI4KKmoi0d3yfsF71YU3S0I5t8.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":393559,"title":"My Life as a Zucchini","description":"After his mother’s death, Zucchini is befriended by a kind police officer, Raymond, who accompanies him to his new foster home filled with other orphans his age. There, with the help of his newfound friends, Zucchini eventually learns to trust and love as he searches for a new family of his own.","duration":"1:06:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Drama"],"release_date":"2016-09-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lTOr8fcxlsLrGfe2lqZLCjhvrIH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2uu8fIzl76C9MFiUQhjKYSLKVq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lTOr8fcxlsLrGfe2lqZLCjhvrIH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2uu8fIzl76C9MFiUQhjKYSLKVq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":335578,"title":"Land of Mine","description":"In the days following the surrender of Germany in May 1945, a group of young German prisoners of war is handed over to the Danish authorities and subsequently sent to the West Coast, where they are ordered to remove the more than two million mines that the Germans had placed in the sand along the coast. With their bare hands, crawling around in the sand, the boys are forced to perform the dangerous work under the leadership of a Danish sergeant.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["War","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2015-12-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vkzeh2G7Gwapo4J1eqGWRph2hCs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/7TOYH2VDnYbXpBKlrkdQZUSC3Du.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//vkzeh2G7Gwapo4J1eqGWRph2hCs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//7TOYH2VDnYbXpBKlrkdQZUSC3Du.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":6844,"title":"The Ten Commandments","description":"Escaping death, a Hebrew infant is raised in a royal household to become a prince. Upon discovery of his true heritage, Moses embarks on a personal quest to reclaim his destiny as the leader and liberator of the Hebrew people.","duration":"3:40:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"1956-11-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3e3dVaVrla2GH6CWKbNRjTvk3s8.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Ei59AR64x6dMZfWobPCkZjbqTL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3e3dVaVrla2GH6CWKbNRjTvk3s8.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Ei59AR64x6dMZfWobPCkZjbqTL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":398924,"title":"A Bag of Marbles","description":"At the beginning of the 1940s, in a France occupied by Nazi forces, lived the Jewish Joffo family. Happy and tight-knit, she sees her future darken when all members of the family are forced to wear the yellow star. Fearing the worst, the parents organized their family to flee to the free zone in the south of the country. Maurice, twelve years old, and Joseph, ten years old, will therefore leave alone in order to maximize their chances of finding their older brothers already settled in Nice.  The brothers left to their own devices demonstrate an incredible amount of cleverness, courage, and ingenuity to escape the enemy invasion and to try to reunite their family once again.","duration":"1:53:00","genre":["War","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-01-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iVQifEAWEGA5ajuTjLFv3kFSIOK.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kjVPBXfo7frULyUzQ8NRPAflP8G.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iVQifEAWEGA5ajuTjLFv3kFSIOK.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kjVPBXfo7frULyUzQ8NRPAflP8G.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":285700,"title":"The Fool","description":"The Fool is a movie about a simple plumber. An honest man, he is up against an entire system of corrupted bureaucrats. At stake are the lives of 800 inhabitants of an old dorm that is at risk of collapsing within the span of the night.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-08-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/c4ewJ2mW1EDf12p8VYV0cZghW3V.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jJOuPUrkpUDETHqfZU0hXWvuWU0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//c4ewJ2mW1EDf12p8VYV0cZghW3V.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jJOuPUrkpUDETHqfZU0hXWvuWU0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":18079,"title":"Nine Queens","description":"Two con artists try to swindle a stamp collector by selling him a sheet of counterfeit rare stamps, the \"nine queens\".","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"2000-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e4tZvefBtA6P1T0vAPfeXG4Bj3r.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u2L4Foderu7SCPci5c3jsUfEJPP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e4tZvefBtA6P1T0vAPfeXG4Bj3r.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u2L4Foderu7SCPci5c3jsUfEJPP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":5915,"title":"Into the Wild","description":"After graduating from Emory University in 1992, top student and athlete Christopher McCandless abandons his possessions, gives his entire $24,000 savings account to charity, and hitchhikes to Alaska to live in the wilderness.","duration":"2:28:00","genre":["Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"2007-09-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/87tmTU1NSR5EUGTKsF5rhLwZtZc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jnLnLYP5pGDfri04gxtAqAvkHMw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//87tmTU1NSR5EUGTKsF5rhLwZtZc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jnLnLYP5pGDfri04gxtAqAvkHMw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31139,"title":"Office Romance","description":"Anatoly Novoseltsev is a mousy single father and office stumblebum working at a statistics bureau in Moscow. In the hopes of being promoted, he is coaxed into charming his disagreeable and seemingly unfeeling boss, Ludmila Kalugina, or \"Meany\" as she''s otherwise known by her subordinates. Helped by his colleagues Olya and Yura, Anatoly attempts to ease the yoke of Ms. Kalugina, and what follows in the wake of his graceless manoeuvres is completely unforeseen, as he awakens a side to her not yet known, even to herself..","duration":"2:39:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance"],"release_date":"1977-10-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qnALlAgoQu6rDVKsuFJ7WDvLQjm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/21TgZRiA5gDlyCwQEyYqZcqwMgN.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qnALlAgoQu6rDVKsuFJ7WDvLQjm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//21TgZRiA5gDlyCwQEyYqZcqwMgN.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9475,"title":"Scent of a Woman","description":"Charlie Simms is a student at a private preparatory school who comes from a poor family. To earn the money for his flight home to Gresham, Oregon for Christmas, Charlie takes a job over Thanksgiving looking after retired U.S. Army officer Lieutenant Colonel Frank Slade, a cantankerous middle-aged man who lives with his niece and her family.","duration":"2:36:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1992-12-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fa03pD2qYmms4ZMgAv7PMqfFiGO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4adI7IaveWb7EidYXfLb3MK3CgO.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fa03pD2qYmms4ZMgAv7PMqfFiGO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4adI7IaveWb7EidYXfLb3MK3CgO.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29154,"title":"Stand and Deliver","description":"Jaime Escalante is a mathematics teacher in a school in a hispanic neighbourhood. Convinced that his students have potential, he adopts unconventional teaching methods to try and turn gang members and no-hopers into some of the country''s top algebra and calculus students.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1988-03-11","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fSmCPURM80YLuXNvSmU6zoJ52ZN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A9pfzwk02iNl6i9wyk8lNcBkvc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fSmCPURM80YLuXNvSmU6zoJ52ZN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A9pfzwk02iNl6i9wyk8lNcBkvc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11621,"title":"Porco Rosso","description":"In Italy in the 1930s, sky pirates in biplanes terrorize wealthy cruise ships as they sail the Adriatic Sea. The only pilot brave enough to stop the scourge is the mysterious Porco Rosso, a former World War I flying ace who was somehow turned into a pig during the war. As he prepares to battle the pirate crew''s American ace, Porco Rosso enlists the help of spunky girl mechanic Fio Piccolo and his longtime friend Madame Gina.","duration":"1:33:00","genre":["Animation","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1992-07-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ec4m0EvVlEtVl5aySdw6ab9uG0b.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8mIvSvnVBApfORL9N6S38Q7wD6A.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ec4m0EvVlEtVl5aySdw6ab9uG0b.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8mIvSvnVBApfORL9N6S38Q7wD6A.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":527774,"title":"Raya and the Last Dragon","description":"Long ago, in the fantasy world of Kumandra, humans and dragons lived together in harmony. But when an evil force threatened the land, the dragons sacrificed themselves to save humanity. Now, 500 years later, that same evil has returned and it’s up to a lone warrior, Raya, to track down the legendary last dragon to restore the fractured land and its divided people.","duration":"1:47:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Family"],"release_date":"2021-03-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zmX7ObPaRfiCmY6LMalUb1bJDKj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5nVhgCzxKbK47OLIKxCR1syulOn.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zmX7ObPaRfiCmY6LMalUb1bJDKj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5nVhgCzxKbK47OLIKxCR1syulOn.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":11830,"title":"Tampopo","description":"In this humorous paean to the joys of food, a pair of truck drivers happen onto a decrepit roadside shop selling ramen noodles. The widowed owner, Tampopo, begs them to help her turn her establishment into a paragon of the \"art of noodle-soup making\". Interspersed are satirical vignettes about the importance of food to different aspects of human life.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1985-11-23","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oq8HM9TOSbH54Xy0OBJGzYrtUC7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ArYdSuX3zY9fMsE4LqmBl7xJq5R.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oq8HM9TOSbH54Xy0OBJGzYrtUC7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ArYdSuX3zY9fMsE4LqmBl7xJq5R.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":10774,"title":"Network","description":"When veteran anchorman Howard Beale is forced to retire his 25-year post because of his age, he announces to viewers that he will kill himself during his farewell broadcast. Network executives rethink their decision when his fanatical tirade results in a spike in ratings.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1976-11-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m4Iyzh9YVOh0ra7UwdMoJcrjxkx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qZomlHsaALUtkFeMDwdYmwS2Pbo.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https: