hysician, uses an experimental drug to \"awaken\" the catatonic victims of a rare disease. Leonard is the first patient to receive the controversial treatment. His awakening, filled with awe and enthusiasm, proves a rebirth for Sayer too, as the exuberant patient reveals life''s simple but unutterably sweet pleasures to the introverted doctor.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1990-12-04","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tRKTlMoTsAhYpuq19V8Wk3RFY4O.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9gztZXuHLG6AJ0fgqGd7Q43cWRI.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tRKTlMoTsAhYpuq19V8Wk3RFY4O.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9gztZXuHLG6AJ0fgqGd7Q43cWRI.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":165,"title":"Back to the Future Part II","description":"Marty and Doc are at it again as the time-traveling duo head to 2015 to nip some McFly family woes in the bud. But things go awry thanks to bully Biff Tannen and a pesky sports almanac. In a last-ditch attempt to set things straight, Marty finds himself bound for 1955 and face to face with his teenage parents -- again.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"1989-11-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w6tPctxWAsHoQXeKxxNOT6lYKpx.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hQq8xZe5uLjFzSBt4LanNP7SQjl.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w6tPctxWAsHoQXeKxxNOT6lYKpx.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hQq8xZe5uLjFzSBt4LanNP7SQjl.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":568012,"title":"One Piece: Stampede","description":"The world''s boldest buccaneers set sail for the great Pirate Festival, where the Straw Hats join a mad-dash race to find Gol D. Roger''s treasure. There''s just one little problem: An old member of Roger''s crew has a sinister score to settle.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2019-01-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/55NKqRgstL3u1Oxe2gAAJUtx3jM.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4E2lyUGLEr3yH4q6kJxPkQUhX7n.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//55NKqRgstL3u1Oxe2gAAJUtx3jM.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4E2lyUGLEr3yH4q6kJxPkQUhX7n.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":438631,"title":"Dune","description":"Paul Atreides, a brilliant and gifted young man born into a great destiny beyond his understanding, must travel to the most dangerous planet in the universe to ensure the future of his family and his people. As malevolent forces explode into conflict over the planet''s exclusive supply of the most precious resource in existence - a commodity capable of unlocking humanity''s greatest potential - only those who can conquer their fear will survive.","duration":"2:35:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure"],"release_date":"2021-09-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zRKQW58MBEY078AxkHxEJzUskCl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v1tRXZ4JtD2Iv6fjkPvT4GiwslV.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zRKQW58MBEY078AxkHxEJzUskCl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v1tRXZ4JtD2Iv6fjkPvT4GiwslV.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":934,"title":"Rififi","description":"Out of prison after a five-year stretch, jewel thief Tony turns down a quick job his friend Jo offers him, until he discovers that his old girlfriend Mado has become the lover of local gangster Pierre Grutter during Tony''s absence. Expanding a minor smash-and-grab into a full-scale jewel heist, Tony and his crew appear to get away clean, but their actions after the job is completed threaten the lives of everyone involved.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Crime","Thriller","Drama"],"release_date":"1955-04-13","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/cVPBT3Fq