named Shrek. On a mission to retrieve a gorgeous princess from the clutches of a fire-breathing dragon, Shrek teams up with an unlikely compatriot -- a wisecracking donkey.","duration":"1:30:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Fantasy","Adventure","Family"],"release_date":"2001-05-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/w0eKUOEog2ImtktCHAMUZws8qif.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iB64vpL3dIObOtMZgX3RqdVdQDc.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//w0eKUOEog2ImtktCHAMUZws8qif.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iB64vpL3dIObOtMZgX3RqdVdQDc.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":931285,"title":"Mortal Kombat II","description":"The fan favorite champions—now joined by Johnny Cage himself—are pitted against one another in the ultimate, no-holds barred, gory battle to defeat the dark rule of Shao Kahn that threatens the very existence of the Earthrealm and its defenders.","duration":"1:56:00","genre":["Action","Fantasy","Adventure"],"release_date":"2026-05-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4EAAwpylq313qrDqpCxulUrXBNF.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hwRdDFIhaEmpRgoki805YvyyjZf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4EAAwpylq313qrDqpCxulUrXBNF.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hwRdDFIhaEmpRgoki805YvyyjZf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31056,"title":"A Short Film About Love","description":"19-year-old Tomek whiles away his lonely life by spying on his opposite neighbour Magda through binoculars. She''s an artist in her mid-thirties, and appears to have everything - not least a constant stream of men at her beck and call. But when the two finally meet, they discover that they have a lot more in common than appeared at first sight...","duration":"1:27:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1988-08-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mvPL6z8QFhmk67n6o7sNmU2J1fd.