hes, Frida","description":"After being released from prison, Zequi, a bank robber, sets out to recover money buried by his accomplice; but is horrified to learn that a high school gymnasium is now over the site where the loot is hidden.","duration":"1:40:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2016-09-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3z8cveYwdIz2IZRhm6cHu8f2HRT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6HfyXfIEywLa2HvcswKi44dDKxL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3z8cveYwdIz2IZRhm6cHu8f2HRT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6HfyXfIEywLa2HvcswKi44dDKxL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":123025,"title":"Batman: The Dark Knight Returns, Part 1","description":"Batman has not been seen for ten years. A new breed of criminal ravages Gotham City, forcing 55-year-old Bruce Wayne back into the cape and cowl. But, does he still have what it takes to fight crime in a new era?","duration":"1:16:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Action","Animation","Mystery"],"release_date":"2012-09-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1YaG52CwGY3pKh76OBlwX0ymncg.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rVr2Tdp2LcL3DheXUrVN345Myhg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1YaG52CwGY3pKh76OBlwX0ymncg.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rVr2Tdp2LcL3DheXUrVN345Myhg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":45752,"title":"Scooby-Doo! Camp Scare","description":"Scooby and the gang experience outdoor fun as they go back to Fred''s old summer camp. As summer goes on, it becomes increasingly clear that the spooky camp stories told by the fireplace, are more real than they''ve though and soon, it''s up to the gang to try and solve the mystery of camp scare.","duration":"1:12:00","genre":["Animation","Comedy","Family","Mystery"],"release_date":"2010-09-14","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oVROUaJkzEBAlNbUKnXQiiKbJRf.j