tle":"All Quiet on the Western Front","description":"Paul Baumer and his friends Albert and Muller, egged on by romantic dreams of heroism, voluntarily enlist in the German army. Full of excitement and patriotic fervour, the boys enthusiastically march into a war they believe in. But once on the Western Front, they discover the soul-destroying horror of World War I.","duration":"2:27:00","genre":["War","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-10-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xBwtP27cx8WfjHJVFkpuV6F1RES.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2IRjbi9cADuDMKmHdLK7LaqQDKA.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xBwtP27cx8WfjHJVFkpuV6F1RES.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2IRjbi9cADuDMKmHdLK7LaqQDKA.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":29845,"title":"A Woman Under the Influence","description":"Mabel Longhetti, desperate and lonely, is married to a Los Angeles municipal construction worker, Nick. Increasingly unstable, especially in the company of others, she craves happiness, but her extremely volatile behavior convinces Nick that she poses a danger to their family and decides to commit her to an institution for six months. Alone with a trio of kids to raise on his own, he awaits her return, which holds more than a few surprises.","duration":"2:35:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1974-11-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uOLcJJYZ3hbFSrKQPDaLhrYnjUv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6EJ4JoTxnH1QmGTE9pPzgtW1cLW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uOLcJJYZ3hbFSrKQPDaLhrYnjUv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6EJ4JoTxnH1QmGTE9pPzgtW1cLW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":715931,"title":"Emancipation","description":"Inspired by the gripping true story of a man who would do anything for his family—and for freedom. When Peter, an enslaved man, risks his life to escape and return to his family, he embarks on a perilous journey of love and endurance.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Drama","War","History"],"release_date":"2022-12-02","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1jZ3wNpON50whGEH7YOcTQrU45B.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/AkdNXEquLf4GIkwh1dcSB7j0FTY.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1jZ3wNpON50whGEH7YOcTQrU45B.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//AkdNXEquLf4GIkwh1dcSB7j0FTY.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":390635,"title":"Fate/stay night: Heaven''s Feel III. Spring Song","description":"The battle rages on as Shirou continues to protect Sakura, now consumed by the darkness. He joins forces with Rin to end the Holy Grail War, while Illyasviel, who knows the truth behind it, confronts her fate. Amidst the chaos, Zouken plots to manipulate Sakura for his own desires. The final fight begins.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Animation","Romance","Fantasy","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2020-08-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tLfQZkB4yBlO1h5WMIFLJgHYcZD.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hIK5kEdFwOHnHTa06ntTVSfG9im.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tLfQZkB4yBlO1h5WMIFLJgHYcZD.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hIK5kEdFwOHnHTa06ntTVSfG9im.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":61979,"title":"Three Steps Above Heaven","description":"Babi, a sheltered upper-class girl, and Hache, a reckless rebel obsessed with illegal motorcycle races, fall into a forbidden love that pulls them deeper into passion and risk.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2010-12-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2Mq10FWFbxoYgsZysWlw7T9wSNe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xeWyY2s13dRlKOLk4E3TkXgM4sS.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2Mq10FWFbxoYgsZysWlw7T9wSNe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xeWyY2s13dRlKOLk4E3TkXgM4sS.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":30959,"title":"Kwaidan","description":"Taking its title from an archaic Japanese word meaning \"ghost story,\" this anthology adapts four folk tales. A penniless samurai marries for money with tragic results. A man stranded in a blizzard is saved by Yuki the Snow Maiden, but his rescue comes at a cost. Blind musician Hoichi is forced to perform for an audience of ghosts. An author relates the story of a samurai who sees another warrior''s reflection in his teacup.","duration":"3:03:00","genre":["Horror","Fantasy","Drama"],"release_date":"1965-01-06","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9GAU0z2wVA8M2D2w36CaloWYYgv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t9UMfViYl47SdZZatKQ1JKjjCgs.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9GAU0z2wVA8M2D2w36CaloWYYgv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t9UMfViYl47SdZZatKQ1JKjjCgs.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":113833,"title":"The Normal Heart","description":"The story of the onset of the HIV-AIDS crisis in New York City in the early 1980s, taking an unflinching look at the nation''s sexual politics as gay activists and their allies in the medical community fight to expose the truth about the burgeoning epidemic to a city and nation in denial.","duration":"2:13:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2014-05-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/ooN5xzaxFmf6EB66OzWUu4BIFgO.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fv7eWAlvFUiyddM4cy4tjXpxJcC.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//ooN5xzaxFmf6EB66OzWUu4BIFgO.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fv7eWAlvFUiyddM4cy4tjXpxJcC.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14811,"title":"Fiddler on the Roof","description":"In a pre-revolutionary Russia, a poor Jewish milkman struggles with the challenges of a changing world as his daughters fall in love and antisemitism grows.","duration":"3:01:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1971-11-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/n1pItGYLcgAh7c0ewjWeXKTjXFT.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/v65PHx7Q6Jx0anyNeUOX07SJic9.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//n1pItGYLcgAh7c0ewjWeXKTjXFT.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//v65PHx7Q6Jx0anyNeUOX07SJic9.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":616584,"title":"K-12","description":"Cry Baby, a strong and sensitive girl, is sent off to a disturbing sleepaway school that’s hidden underneath a grandiose façade. Luckily, she has a sweet and unapologetic best friend who sticks up for her when she gets bullied by the other students whose brains are under control by the Principal and his wicked staff. With the help of the magical friends they meet along the way, as well as an Angelic Spirit Guide, they are able to gain the strength they need to fight off the school’s belligerent patriarchal conditioning.","duration":"1:32:00","genre":["Fantasy","Horror","Music"],"release_date":"2019-09-05","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fSlfaF0Ydfr2SK6hOYHvDsb7a9Z.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/nVi0yBBPj5Z96JgGWVIg94kv7bR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fSlfaF0Ydfr2SK6hOYHvDsb7a9Z.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//nVi0yBBPj5Z96JgGWVIg94kv7bR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":24480,"title":"Partly Cloudy","description":"Everyone knows that the stork delivers babies, but where do the storks get the babies from? The answer lies up in the stratosphere, where cloud people sculpt babies from clouds and bring them to life. Gus, a lonely and insecure grey cloud, is a master at creating \"dangerous\" babies. Crocodiles, porcupines, rams and more - Gus''s beloved creations are works of art, but more than a handful for his loyal delivery stork partner, Peck. As Gus''s creations become more and more rambunctious, Peck''s job gets harder and harder. How will Peck manage to handle both his hazardous cargo and his friend''s fiery temperament?","duration":"0:06:00","genre":["Animation","Family","Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2009-05-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8FQ0QCoyGHpPXRTsv2jaSqV5NRs.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oqYX2AJV53ibLVPrUZ1Z5XlGv5U.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8FQ0QCoyGHpPXRTsv2jaSqV5NRs.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oqYX2AJV53ibLVPrUZ1Z5XlGv5U.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":22596,"title":"Safety Last!","description":"When a store clerk organizes a contest to climb the outside of a tall building, circumstances force him to make the perilous climb himself.","duration":"1:13:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"1923-03-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3zo6ZONR4Mth2nWFbQK9dhCWbVz.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fEt5HWJ32ek8ibef7zSZnA00Jp0.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3zo6ZONR4Mth2nWFbQK9dhCWbVz.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fEt5HWJ32ek8ibef7zSZnA00Jp0.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":203217,"title":"My Mom Is a Character","description":"After another spat with her kids, Dona Hermínia decides to take some time off from them and hides away in her aunt''s house, where she reminisces about her kids in an age when they still needed her.","duration":"1:24:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"2013-06-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fUfPjSBBRlbBBbyWdGVEm222wlN.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/veCMD8bzoLuXiSGPCXCFKwJSO9v.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fUfPjSBBRlbBBbyWdGVEm222wlN.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//veCMD8bzoLuXiSGPCXCFKwJSO9v.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":903,"title":"Cool Hand Luke","description":"When petty criminal Luke Jackson is sentenced to two years in a Florida prison farm, he doesn''t play by the rules of either the sadistic warden or the yard''s resident heavy, Dragline, who ends up admiring the new guy''s unbreakable will. Luke''s bravado, even in the face of repeated stints in the prison''s dreaded solitary confinement cell, \"the box,\" make him a rebel hero to his fellow convicts and a thorn in the side of the prison officers.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama","Crime"],"release_date":"1967-11-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9TDi0FPOSAePfVLZXAUgFZhiMLf.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4ykzTiHKLamh3eZJ8orVICtU2Jp.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9TDi0FPOSAePfVLZXAUgFZhiMLf.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4ykzTiHKLamh3eZJ8orVICtU2Jp.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":404,"title":"The Straight Story","description":"Retired farmer and widower Alvin Straight learns one day that his estranged brother Lyle has suffered a severe stroke. Alvin is determined to make things right with Lyle while he still can, but his brother lives in Wisconsin, while Alvin is stuck in Iowa with no car and no driver''s license. He then has the idea of making the trip on his old lawnmower, thus beginning a picturesque and at times deeply spiritual odyssey.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1999-10-15","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1S81PpyGwS8eVx4W75uSKzMw4B0.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tT9cMiVDdtlcdZxOoFy3VRmEoKk.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1S81PpyGwS8eVx4W75uSKzMw4B0.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tT9cMiVDdtlcdZxOoFy3VRmEoKk.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":842859,"title":"The Most Precious of Cargoes","description":"Once upon a time, a poor woodcutter and his wife lived in a great forest. Cold, hunger, poverty, and a war raging all around them meant their lives were very hard.  One day, the woodcutter''s wife rescues a baby. A baby girl thrown from one of the many trains that constantly pass through the forest. This baby, this \"most precious of cargoes\", will transform the lives of the poor woodcutter''s wife and her husband, as well as those whose paths the child will cross—including the man who threw her from the train. And some will try to protect her, whatever the cost. Their story will reveal the worst and the best in the hearts of men.","duration":"1:21:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","History"],"release_date":"2024-11-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oaYeZs1DMdyJC1Q2WJNBZ6uT6no.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9bcxbzKTE0bPQCHw5AvXo3in57m.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oaYeZs1DMdyJC1Q2WJNBZ6uT6no.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9bcxbzKTE0bPQCHw5AvXo3in57m.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":492188,"title":"Marriage Story","description":"A stage director and an actress struggle through a grueling, coast-to-coast divorce that pushes them to their personal extremes.","duration":"2:17:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"2019-09-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wDwQXLDUuiEaaiuWIDBpbqnwYGX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2JRyCKaRKyJAVpsIHeLvPw5nHmw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wDwQXLDUuiEaaiuWIDBpbqnwYGX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2JRyCKaRKyJAVpsIHeLvPw5nHmw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":58129,"title":"The Phantom Carriage","description":"An alcoholic, abusive ne''er-do-well is shown the error of his ways through a legend that dooms the last person to die on New Year''s Eve before the clock strikes twelve to take the reins of Death''s chariot and work tirelessly collecting fresh souls for the next year.","duration":"1:48:00","genre":["Drama","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"1921-01-01","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zMqJoVJXQPvkjZ1SZ03e4EuKMfm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yGNekNFaI4SeyDO8C0BkRXM6Byu.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zMqJoVJXQPvkjZ1SZ03e4EuKMfm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yGNekNFaI4SeyDO8C0BkRXM6Byu.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":26955,"title":"Oasis","description":"A young man released from prison visits the widow of the man he killed drunk-driving and becomes infatuated with his cerebral palsy-stricken daughter.","duration":"2:12:00","genre":["Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"2002-08-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zUnF9O3Wy8XVtz9GXgouA4k8Gu2.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aaajiBpeBVbVwovpSQKaMfKRGKw.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zUnF9O3Wy8XVtz9GXgouA4k8Gu2.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aaajiBpeBVbVwovpSQKaMfKRGKw.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":12444,"title":"Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 1","description":"Harry, Ron and Hermione walk away from their last year at Hogwarts to find and destroy the remaining Horcruxes, putting an end to Voldemort''s bid for immortality. But with Harry''s beloved Dumbledore dead and Voldemort''s unscrupulous Death Eaters on the loose, the world is more dangerous than ever.","duration":"2:26:00","genre":["Adventure","Fantasy"],"release_date":"2010-11-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5i2QAYnbN5vOZUUolLPYHTb9spe.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iGoXIpQb7Pot00EEdwpwPajheZ5.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5i2QAYnbN5vOZUUolLPYHTb9spe.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iGoXIpQb7Pot00EEdwpwPajheZ5.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":423612,"title":"Never Look Away","description":"German artist Kurt Barnert has escaped East Germany and now lives in West Germany, but is tormented by his childhood under the Nazis and the GDR regime.","duration":"3:08:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","History"],"release_date":"2018-10-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lFLQNIkNVIHLXNVDHbt4pow4lXc.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fn0Tp9SG0IQ3Nx8iHPYPiseLMWd.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lFLQNIkNVIHLXNVDHbt4pow4lXc.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fn0Tp9SG0IQ3Nx8iHPYPiseLMWd.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":369145,"title":"Doctor Who: The Snowmen","description":"The Doctor has retired to 1892 London. Despite the protests of his allies, he is determined to keep out of mankind''s affairs. However, a governess named Clara has stumbled upon a plot which only the Doctor can unravel, involving the death of her predecessor in ice and the sinister Dr. Simeon, who controls monsters made of sentient snow. And there is another mystery afoot: Clara is the spitting image of Oswin Oswald, whom the Doctor saw die in the Dalek asylum...","duration":"1:00:00","genre":["TV Movie","Adventure","Science Fiction","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2012-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lOeiDYq9aZrgLKZy7Sh2hO1ElNX.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yiJ7aLeGhLbUXE6XkQX9WxyhYhD.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lOeiDYq9aZrgLKZy7Sh2hO1ElNX.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yiJ7aLeGhLbUXE6XkQX9WxyhYhD.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":45269,"title":"The King''s Speech","description":"The King''s Speech tells the story of the man who became King George VI, the father of Queen Elizabeth II. After his brother abdicates, George (''Bertie'') reluctantly assumes the throne. Plagued by a dreaded stutter and considered unfit to be king, Bertie engages the help of an unorthodox speech therapist named Lionel Logue. Through a set of unexpected techniques, and as a result of an unlikely friendship, Bertie is able to find his voice and boldly lead the country into war.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","History"],"release_date":"2010-11-26","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m4MGxxEgAMqIX9x8MCg5pYeyYjU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/pVNKXVQFukBaCz6ML7GH3kiPlQP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m4MGxxEgAMqIX9x8MCg5pYeyYjU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//pVNKXVQFukBaCz6ML7GH3kiPlQP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":272,"title":"Batman Begins","description":"Driven by tragedy, billionaire Bruce Wayne dedicates his life to uncovering and defeating the corruption that plagues his home, Gotham City.  Unable to work within the system, he instead creates a new identity, a symbol of fear for the criminal underworld - The Batman.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Drama","Crime","Action"],"release_date":"2005-06-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9IIBboV7MCT0bTxzXHmWK1Hq558.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/sPX89Td70IDDjVr85jdSBb4rWGr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//9IIBboV7MCT0bTxzXHmWK1Hq558.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//sPX89Td70IDDjVr85jdSBb4rWGr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":27670,"title":"Nothing Left to Do But Cry","description":"Two 20th-century friends accidentally stumble into the year 1492, where they meet a charming teen and try to alter history.","duration":"1:52:00","genre":["Comedy","Fantasy"],"release_date":"1984-12-20","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jBP00fK8DfAhmmc2d6y1nUkhdjY.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/4CX5fwuwZBehGDt6PhSMr49aMT7.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jBP00fK8DfAhmmc2d6y1nUkhdjY.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//4CX5fwuwZBehGDt6PhSMr49aMT7.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":14624,"title":"The Ultimate Gift","description":"When his wealthy grandfather finally dies, Jason Stevens fully expects to benefit when it comes to the reading of the will. But instead of a sizable inheritance, Jason receives a test, a series of tasks he must complete before he can get any money.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Romance","Drama","Family"],"release_date":"2007-03-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/t6ohjYxnEolUGupwvsIHioWfVxl.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8BdVk1u110lwHFELTEO9HrPrIDa.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//t6ohjYxnEolUGupwvsIHioWfVxl.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8BdVk1u110lwHFELTEO9HrPrIDa.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":9806,"title":"The Incredibles","description":"Bob Parr has given up his superhero days to log in time as an insurance adjuster and raise his three children with his formerly heroic wife in suburbia. But when he receives a mysterious assignment, it''s time to get back into costume.","duration":"1:55:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Animation","Family"],"release_date":"2004-10-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lxwzY9vNwjDgxWKt3zZ6zcU6rEJ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2LqaLgk4Z226KkgPJuiOQ58wvrm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lxwzY9vNwjDgxWKt3zZ6zcU6rEJ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2LqaLgk4Z226KkgPJuiOQ58wvrm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":916192,"title":"The Tunnel to Summer, the Exit of Goodbyes","description":"Urashima Tunnel – Once you enter that tunnel, you can get whatever you want, but at a price. Kaoru Tohno, who seems to have an elusive personality and traumatic past, and Anzu Hanashiro, who is struggling to reconcile her ideal image and true-to-heart attitude, team up to investigate the Urashima Tunnel and get what they want. This is an unforgettable summer story of nostalgia and sprinting in a remote countryside.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Animation","Drama","Romance","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2022-09-09","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/rWJc5BkI7Op1IYMb3gW6qGjOnIp.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/5AGA6pbBKXZTI8k1c6odx30JuQR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//rWJc5BkI7Op1IYMb3gW6qGjOnIp.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//5AGA6pbBKXZTI8k1c6odx30JuQR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":613868,"title":"Cousins","description":"Lucas is a young man who lives with his religious aunt Lourdes in a quiet country town. He helps his aunt by holding religious meetings with the ladies of the area, in the living room, playing biblical songs on the keyboard. This quiet life will end as soon as the charitable aunt communicates the arrival of another nephew, Mario, just out of jail. The clash of reality between the cousins ends up causing unusual situations, and an unexpected attraction among the boys.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Comedy","Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2019-12-10","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1QrEQHXX8nqquTBam25HiMrTRTH.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2o0pzmuQKFhuPnz4hvpfjd3BlNR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1QrEQHXX8nqquTBam25HiMrTRTH.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2o0pzmuQKFhuPnz4hvpfjd3BlNR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":25253,"title":"Crooks in Clover","description":"An aging gangster, Fernand Naudin is hoping for a quiet retirement when he suddenly inherits a fortune from an old friend, a former gangster supremo known as the Mexican. If he is ambivalent about his new found wealth, Fernand is positively nonplussed to discover that he has also inherited his benefactor’s daughter, Patricia. Unfortunately, not only does Fernand have to put up with the thoroughly modern Patricia and her nauseating boyfriend, but he also had to contend with the Mexican’s trigger-happy former employees, who are determined to make a claim.","duration":"1:51:00","genre":["Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1963-11-27","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2pnfUSFqUPn9F4mzl1MLKrlnNbU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1uYCIsMpX7FtWu2xO1YMIAQYvLR.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2pnfUSFqUPn9F4mzl1MLKrlnNbU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1uYCIsMpX7FtWu2xO1YMIAQYvLR.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":23832,"title":"For Love and Gold","description":"A group of rogues steal a scroll granting its bearer the property of the land of Aurocastro in Apulia, a province in the south of Italy. They elect a shaggy knight, Brancaleone from Norcia, as their leader, and decide to get possession of this supposedly wealthy land. Many adventures will occurr during the journey.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["Comedy","Adventure"],"release_date":"1966-04-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dELiIRHrpNpncIApojSW67kPNdQ.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/zRdd1qYJpxKKy57ufAK4E7gi13W.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dELiIRHrpNpncIApojSW67kPNdQ.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//zRdd1qYJpxKKy57ufAK4E7gi13W.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":15999,"title":"Vampire Hunter D: Bloodlust","description":"Legendary dhampir D competes with a motley family of bounty hunters to track down Charlotte Elbourne, a young woman seemingly abducted by undead nobleman Meier Link.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Animation","Fantasy","Horror"],"release_date":"2001-04-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lwkwVTNdNeG0a1FT06wr1Ylm1OV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/9ipbQRgOq6Ilxpwagfa98ikgR9v.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lwkwVTNdNeG0a1FT06wr1Ylm1OV.jpg","small_poster_p