d, and the criminals are forced to court him to retrieve their diamonds.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Adventure","Comedy","Crime"],"release_date":"1969-04-28","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/azc8hiaT0sNAxNP1MSC591Oxod1.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/iwVRDsZAuJmulnPKeYxhezzpr9A.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//azc8hiaT0sNAxNP1MSC591Oxod1.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//iwVRDsZAuJmulnPKeYxhezzpr9A.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":317182,"title":"Doctor Who: Last Christmas","description":"The Doctor and Clara face their Last Christmas. Trapped on an Arctic base, under attack from terrifying creatures, who are you going to call? Santa Claus!","duration":"0:57:00","genre":["Science Fiction","Adventure","Drama"],"release_date":"2014-12-25","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/A0h4y7TdMJOQN3C4G9D8qNJlnom.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/a5XHo7MQgX3V7nNlEnl5gwZURDL.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//A0h4y7TdMJOQN3C4G9D8qNJlnom.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//a5XHo7MQgX3V7nNlEnl5gwZURDL.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":873,"title":"The Color Purple","description":"An epic tale spanning forty years in the life of Celie, an African-American woman living in the South who survives incredible abuse and bigotry. After Celie''s abusive father marries her off to the equally debasing ''Mister'' Albert Johnson, things go from bad to worse, leaving Celie to find companionship anywhere she can. She perseveres, holding on to her dream of one day being reunited with her sister in Africa.","duration":"2:34:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1985-12-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lh6MbyxwCribn3hdAo81xLdPGoV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6bvxkcTAXyqxGRwo38mxw92D6Xr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/