/w342//riSUxwoK3xjkOgy6YJSvPhi7cO6.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":428493,"title":"God''s Own Country","description":"A young farmer in rural Yorkshire numbs his daily frustrations with binge drinking and casual sex, until the arrival of a Romanian migrant worker.","duration":"1:44:00","genre":["Romance","Drama"],"release_date":"2017-08-31","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/8lWceqnTavoELCz7TP4pG9pd1CU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/hKJz8Moim43P1f1kGrM9Gh0c0rf.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//8lWceqnTavoELCz7TP4pG9pd1CU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//hKJz8Moim43P1f1kGrM9Gh0c0rf.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":966220,"title":"Sniper: The White Raven","description":"Mykola is an eccentric pacifist who wants to be useful to humanity. When the war begins in Donbas, Mykola’s naive world is collapsing as the militants kill his pregnant wife and burn his home to the ground. Recovered, he makes a cardinal decision and gets enlisted in a sniper company. Having met his wife’s killers, he emotionally breaks down and arranges “sniper terror” for the enemy.","duration":"2:00:00","genre":["War","Action","Drama"],"release_date":"2022-05-03","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/oal5fDK90yX6b8yunj6JahBqX2J.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/lZOODJzwuQo0etJJyBBZJOSdZcW.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//oal5fDK90yX6b8yunj6JahBqX2J.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//lZOODJzwuQo0etJJyBBZJOSdZcW.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":609242,"title":"The Heist of the Century","description":"In 2006, a group of thieves performed what is considered one of the most famous and smart bank heists in the history of Argentina. How they robbed the Rio bank is as surprising as what happened afterwards. This is their story.","duration":"1:54:00","genre":["Comedy","Thriller","Crime"],"release_date":"2020-01-16","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/wEVSupeNO7EjjCFieEv2zt4oJei.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/1zL4VCVin4S8kOXhszMDqfwWPCM.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//wEVSupeNO7EjjCFieEv2zt4oJei.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//1zL4VCVin4S8kOXhszMDqfwWPCM.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":56068,"title":"The Band of Honest Men","description":"Italy, mid ''60s. Three guys from a poor neighbourhood try to get rich by printing fake money using the fact that one of them works as a typographer. The story unravels around their embarrassed efforts to spend the money, their little family issues and ends with a surprise.","duration":"1:41:00","genre":["Comedy"],"release_date":"1956-04-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yxP7WzDU2sKwW9jx3FUofvH8N0X.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eIxcQHq9WDWmcDoJ1qVxhQWlstX.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yxP7WzDU2sKwW9jx3FUofvH8N0X.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eIxcQHq9WDWmcDoJ1qVxhQWlstX.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":31589,"title":"The Bad Sleep Well","description":"In this loose adaptation of \"Hamlet,\" illegitimate son Kôichi Nishi climbs to a high position within a Japanese corporation and marries the crippled daughter of company vice president Iwabuchi. At the reception, the wedding cake is a replica of their corporate headquarters, but an aspect of the design reminds the party of the hushed-up death of Nishi''s father. It is then that Nishi unleashes his plan to avenge his father''s death.","duration":"2:30:00","genre":["Crime","Drama","Thriller"],"release_date":"1960-09-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/m9NzvzYugcjkkZ5A3WdQhI3Mbe7.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/z0LhZ121uaqa31RUeu1mOnaFb5w.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//m9NzvzYugcjkkZ5A3WdQhI3Mbe7.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//z0LhZ121uaqa31RUeu1mOnaFb5w.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":334,"title":"Magnolia","description":"On one random day in the San Fernando Valley, a dying father, a young wife, a male caretaker, a famous lost son, a police officer in love, a boy genius, an ex-boy genius, a game show host and an estranged daughter will each become part of a dazzling multiplicity of plots, but one story.","duration":"3:09:00","genre":["Drama"],"release_date":"1999-12-17","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/mFfyE5DPFDqoes4HIcElHc2a15y.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tpfC325Jk6S38VTe5dDWjWtoyxr.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//mFfyE5DPFDqoes4HIcElHc2a15y.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tpfC325Jk6S38VTe5dDWjWtoyxr.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":382591,"title":"Two Is a Family","description":"A man without attachments or responsibilities suddenly finds himself with an abandoned baby and leaves for London to try and find the mother. Eight years later after he and his daughter become inseparable Gloria''s mother reappears.","duration":"1:58:00","genre":["Drama","Comedy"],"release_date":"2016-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fO0qXJnBJYuWJ5dvWWGXfRF8MXA.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/aFgtdhuzgI2eqnIVWtRB03x3pnt.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fO0qXJnBJYuWJ5dvWWGXfRF8MXA.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//aFgtdhuzgI2eqnIVWtRB03x3pnt.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":205,"title":"Hotel Rwanda","description":"Inspired by true events, this film takes place in Rwanda in the 1990s when more than a million Tutsis were killed in a genocide that went mostly unnoticed by the rest of the world. Hotel owner Paul Rusesabagina houses over a thousand refuges in his hotel in attempt to save their lives.","duration":"2:02:00","genre":["Drama","History","War"],"release_date":"2004-12-22","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/jkvvXaN7FPVKGlk8oj9PL0FHNtj.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/p3pHw85UMZPegfMZBA6dZ06yarm.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//jkvvXaN7FPVKGlk8oj9PL0FHNtj.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//p3pHw85UMZPegfMZBA6dZ06yarm.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":162,"title":"Edward Scissorhands","description":"A small suburban town receives a visit from a castaway unfinished science experiment named Edward.","duration":"1:45:00","genre":["Fantasy","Drama","Romance"],"release_date":"1990-12-07","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/uNLIMPxknsV4n3IAEDpS1iqF5dm.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e0FqKFvGPdQNWG8tF9cZBtev9Em.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//uNLIMPxknsV4n3IAEDpS1iqF5dm.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e0FqKFvGPdQNWG8tF9cZBtev9Em.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":882569,"title":"Guy Ritchie''s The Covenant","description":"After an ambush, Afghan interpreter Ahmed goes to Herculean lengths to save US Army Sergeant John Kinley''s life. When Kinley learns that Ahmed and his family were not given safe passage to America as promised, he must return to the war zone and repay his debt.","duration":"2:03:00","genre":["War","Action","Thriller"],"release_date":"2023-04-19","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/eTvN54pd83TrSEOz6wbsXEJktCV.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kVG8zFFYrpyYLoHChuEeOGAd6Ru.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//eTvN54pd83TrSEOz6wbsXEJktCV.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kVG8zFFYrpyYLoHChuEeOGAd6Ru.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":28276,"title":"Good Morning","description":"Two boys beg their parents for a television set, nagging them until all patience is lost. The parents order the boys to be quiet and the boys do exactly that--refusing to utter a word. The boys'' silence ultimately puts the whole neighborhood into turmoil.","duration":"1:34:00","genre":["Comedy","Family","Drama"],"release_date":"1959-05-12","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/qH9wiXnx9mU9kNGCH1exaey9CqU.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/dXy2LFsE0VlHlHJU3SLBdJgrzEq.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//qH9wiXnx9mU9kNGCH1exaey9CqU.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//dXy2LFsE0VlHlHJU3SLBdJgrzEq.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":545611,"title":"Everything Everywhere All at Once","description":"An aging Chinese immigrant is swept up in an insane adventure, where she alone can save what''s important to her by connecting with the lives she could have led in other universes.","duration":"2:20:00","genre":["Action","Adventure","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2022-03-24","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/fIwiFha3WPu5nHkBeMQ4GzEk0Hv.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/u68AjlvlutfEIcpmbYpKcdi09ut.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//fIwiFha3WPu5nHkBeMQ4GzEk0Hv.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//u68AjlvlutfEIcpmbYpKcdi09ut.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":16052,"title":"Selena","description":"In this biographical drama, Selena Quintanilla is born into a musical Mexican-American family in Texas. Her father, Abraham, realizes that his young daughter is talented and begins performing with her at small venues. She finds success and falls for her guitarist, Chris Perez, who draws the ire of her father. Seeking mainstream stardom, Selena begins recording an English-language album which, tragically, she would never complete.","duration":"2:07:00","genre":["Drama","Music","History"],"release_date":"1997-03-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/kcBlY5FasH8ti150aYExULw53ui.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/j8xX3yBAFOayfSaImgLZPnAcdWz.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//kcBlY5FasH8ti150aYExULw53ui.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//j8xX3yBAFOayfSaImgLZPnAcdWz.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":453191,"title":"The Big Bad Fox and Other Tales","description":"The countryside isn''t always as calm and peaceful as it''s made out to be, and the animals on this farm are particularly agitated: a fox who mothers a family of chicks, a rabbit who plays the stork, and a duck who wants to be Santa Claus.","duration":"1:23:00","genre":["Family","Animation","Comedy"],"release_date":"2017-06-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/xte6dUGLvFss0ZJIau9avtrfTQR.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/3Nib5a3p2O7yPFSTTNwChp0cnsh.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//xte6dUGLvFss0ZJIau9avtrfTQR.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//3Nib5a3p2O7yPFSTTNwChp0cnsh.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":413594,"title":"Sword Art Online the Movie: Ordinal Scale","description":"In 2026, a new machine called the Augma is developed to compete against the NerveGear and its successor, the Amusphere. A next-gen wearable device, the Augma doesn''t have a full-dive function like its predecessors. Instead, it uses Augmented Reality to get players into the game. It is safe, user-friendly and lets users play while they are conscious, making it an instant hit on the market. The most popular game on the system is “Ordinal Scale” an ARMMORPG developed exclusively for the Augma. Asuna and the gang have already been playing OS for a while, by the time Kirito decides to join them. They’re about to find out that Ordinal Scale isn’t all fun and games…","duration":"1:59:00","genre":["Animation","Action","Adventure","Fantasy","Science Fiction"],"release_date":"2017-02-18","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/yFZG86Zvdy6JuIlMW9eHxlVkct5.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/2szdEK0Mr0RG0nWGFVTseNQHbnP.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//yFZG86Zvdy6JuIlMW9eHxlVkct5.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//2szdEK0Mr0RG0nWGFVTseNQHbnP.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":303,"title":"Notorious","description":"In order to help bring Nazis to justice, U.S. government agent T.R. Devlin recruits Alicia Huberman, the American daughter of a convicted German war criminal, as a spy. As they begin to fall for one another, Alicia is instructed to win the affections of Alexander Sebastian, a Nazi hiding out in Brazil. When Sebastian becomes serious about his relationship with Alicia, the stakes get higher, and Devlin must watch her slip further undercover.","duration":"1:43:00","genre":["Drama","Romance","Thriller"],"release_date":"1946-08-21","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/6jRd6vT3NhwIeyqaiWCYzi64lSP.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/e7DHQGgivZyMvM4z7mA7gMNvOHg.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//6jRd6vT3NhwIeyqaiWCYzi64lSP.jpg","small_poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//e7DHQGgivZyMvM4z7mA7gMNvOHg.jpg"},{"tmdb_id":357786,"title":"Kizumonogatari Part 1: Tekketsu","description":"One day, Koyomi Araragi encounters the horrifying vampire, Kiss-shot Acerola-orion Heart-under-blade A.K.A. the \"King of Apparitions.\" He saves the fatally wounded Kiss-shot by offering his blood at the expense of his own life as a human. Now Koyomi has to face the vampire hunters to retrieve Kiss-shot’s limbs which were taken by these hunters...","duration":"1:03:00","genre":["Animation","Fantasy","Drama","Mystery","Action"],"release_date":"2016-01-08","backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/tDM4UAaHxMrvODGIUj9ZixmyVmw.jpg","poster_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_face/vftYhVOdvMCmb0dQIRIKmUYG9TU.jpg","small_backdrop_path":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342//tDM4UAaHxMrvODGIUj9ZixmyVmw.jpg","small_poster_path